msgstr "Нужно немного электричества."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "It'll be good for when winter comes."
msgstr "Она пригодится, когда придёт зима."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Its measuring days are over."
msgstr "Дни его измерений подошли к концу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "Mercurial."
msgstr "Содержит ртуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "The spirit of the season!"
msgstr "Дух этого времени года!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING"
msgid "The science is almost done!"
msgstr "Наука почти закончена!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING"
msgid "Cooking really is a science."
msgstr "Кулинария - это действительно настоящая наука."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY"
msgid "Science says it's done."
msgstr "Наука говорит, что оно готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A festive furnace for flame-grilled foodstuffs!"
msgstr "Праздничная печь для блюд на огне!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "The anatomy's not right, but I'll overlook it."
msgstr "С анатомией что-то не так, но можно это и проигнорировать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "I'm going to eat forty. For science."
msgstr "Я бы съел сорок таких. Во имя науки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "A Yuletide toothache waiting to happen."
msgstr "От этого будут зудеть зубы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "That experiment may have been a tiny bit unethical."
msgstr "Этот эксперимент может получиться немного неэтичным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "It's nice to eat something other than berries for once."
msgstr "Приятно хоть изредка есть хоть что-то, кроме ягод."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "I'm puddin' that straight in my mouth!"
msgstr "Прямо мне в рот!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "It's a hollowed apple filled with yummy juice."
msgstr "Чашка из яблока, заполненная вкусным соком."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "How does it stay warm? A thermodynamical mug?"
msgstr "И как оно остается теплым?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "Can science explain why it tastes so good?"
msgstr "Может ли наука объяснить, почему это так божественно на вкус?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Every scientist appreciates a good bauble."
msgstr "Каждый учёный ценит милые побрякушки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "This one is especially impressive."
msgstr "А вот эта действительно впечатляет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "I should hang this one over a fire."
msgstr "Я должен повесить это над огнём."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "For some reason it makes me hungry."
msgstr "Из-за этого я почему-то чувствую голод."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "A tree's not complete without some electricity."
msgstr "Какой праздник без гирлянд?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL"
msgid "Really fine work considering she has claws."
msgstr "Действительно прекрасная работа, учитывая, что у неё клешни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "That was a mistake, I think."
msgstr "Думаю, это была ошибка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "That puts a damper on the festivities."
msgstr "Омрачает праздничные дни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE"
msgid "Happy Winter's Feast!"
msgstr "Счастливого банкета!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG"
msgid "It's almost Winter's Feast!"
msgstr "Праздник начинается!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "That puts a damper on the festivities."
msgstr "Омрачает праздничные дни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "I need a pine cone for that."
msgstr "Мне понадобится шишка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "It's a rock with Wobsters in it."
msgstr "Это камень с вобстерами внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS"
msgid "What a wascally Lunar Wobster."
msgstr "Что за подлый лунный вобстер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
msgid "What a wascally Wobster."
msgstr "Что за подлый вобстер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD"
msgid "You should cook up nicely."
msgstr "Тебя следует приготовить с душой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
msgid "I can't wait to eat you."
msgstr "Не могу дождаться, чтобы съесть тебя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1"
msgid "What in the name of science have you been feeding her?"
msgstr "Чем, во имя науки, ты её кормил?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2"
msgid "What in the name of science have you been feeding her?"
msgstr "Чем, во имя науки, ты её кормил?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1"
msgid "It's a scientific fact that petting a good dog will improve your day."
msgstr "Если погладишь собаку, то и день пройдёт лучше — научный факт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2"
msgid "It's a scientific fact that petting a good dog will improve your day."
msgstr "Если погладишь собаку, то и день пройдёт лучше — научный факт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT"
msgid "I think I'm barking up the wrong tree with this snack."
msgstr "Кажется, я ошибся в расчётах с этой закуской."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "Let's not start a fight with the strongman..."
msgstr "Давайте лучше не будем затевать драку с силачом..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You can't actually \"fight\" fire, %s!"
msgstr "Ты не можешь победить огонь силой, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's good to see you, %s!"
msgstr "Рад тебя видеть, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "I told you you couldn't deadlift that boulder. The numbers were all wrong."
msgstr "А я предупреждал, что тебе не поднять ту каменюку. Его вес оказался обманчив."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! I can take you!"
msgstr "Убийца! Я до тебя доберусь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is just a big teddy bear."
msgstr "%s — просто большой плюшевый медведь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE"
msgid "It gives me terrible flashbacks to the gym classes of my youth..."
msgstr "У меня плохие воспоминания с уроков физкультуры..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER"
msgid "Hey, stop monkeying around!"
msgstr "Эй, хватит обезьянничать!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I wonder if this is how the dinosaurs felt."
msgstr "Интересно, так ли чувствовали себя динозавры?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a monkey."
msgstr "Обезьян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST"
msgid "That's one spooky monkey."
msgstr "А это жуткий обезьян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER"
msgid "They've gone ape!"
msgstr "Безумная макака!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER"
msgid "My life has been saved... by a monkey?"
msgstr "Моя жизнь была спасена... обезьяной?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT"
msgid "It looks like it's been lovingly carved."
msgstr "Вырезана с любовью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has been a bit of a sap lately..."
msgstr "%s, кажется, сегодня встал не с той ноги..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "%s's gone on a wood chucking rampage!"
msgstr "%s переработался на лесозаготовке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "Will you bea-very mad if I don't revive you, %s?"
msgstr "Надеюсь, ты будешь бобрее, если я оживлю тебя, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't burn yourself out, %s."
msgstr "Себя лучше не поджигать, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s!"
msgstr "Привет, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "Does \"universal\" coverage include the void, %s?"
msgstr "Видишь ли ты свет в конце тоннеля, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE"
msgid "Take a gander at that!"
msgstr "Смотри-ка, каков гусь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST"
msgid "Be more careful, you silly goose!"
msgstr "Будь осторожнее, глупый гусь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE"
msgid "Gad-zooks, that's a moose!"
msgstr "Ох, небось это лось!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST"
msgid "That moose'nt be very comfortable."
msgstr "Быть лосём оказа-лось не очень удобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! Bring me an axe and let's get in the swing of things!"
msgstr "Убийца! Принесите мне топор, и мы схлестнёмся звоном оружия!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "%s saved everyone's backbacon."
msgstr "%s — спаситель чужих задниц."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT"
msgid "I wouldn't like to sit on that."
