msgstr "Посеребрённая тарелка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT"
msgid "A little salty spring."
msgstr "Маленький солёный источник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL
