#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY"
