#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2"
