#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG"
