msgstr "Удивительно пугающая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
