msgstr "Ещё несколько таких обрывков, и я могла бы создать новый узор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST"
msgid "A good place to secure a beefalo."
msgstr "Хорошее место, чтобы привязать бифало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "Unfortunately, it didn't come preassembled."
msgstr "К сожалению, она не была предварительно собрана."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
msgid "At least it's faster than sewing by hand."
msgstr "По крайней мере, это быстрее, чем шить вручную."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM"
msgid "Unfortunately, it didn't come preassembled."
msgstr "К сожалению, она не была предварительно собрана."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "What a strange fellow. A shame he doesn't pop by more often."
msgstr "Какой странный товарищ. Жаль, он не появляется чаще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
msgid "Unfortunately, it didn't come preassembled."
msgstr "К сожалению, она не была предварительно собрана."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Gone too soon."
msgstr "Сгорело слишком быстро."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Well this helps me narrow down my temporal location."
msgstr "Что ж, это поможет мне сузить моё временное местоположение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I suppose there's time to fashion a trinket or two."
msgstr "Думаю, у меня есть время на пару безделушек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "Oh botheration, now I'll have to build another!"
msgstr "Ох, зараза, теперь придётся строить новый!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "I wish I could improve my own sense of direction..."
msgstr "Если бы только я могла улучшить собственное умение ориентироваться..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "I'm getting dizzy just watching it."
msgstr "От одного его вида уже голова кружится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "The preparations are done, now to find a place for it."
msgstr "Подготовка закончена, теперь нужно найти место для него."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "That sure burnt away quickly."
msgstr "Он сгорел так быстро."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "I want my carrat to be a quick thinker."
msgstr "Хотелось бы, чтобы моя морквокрыса соображала быстрее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "It looks smarter already!"
msgstr "Она уже выглядит умнее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "I hope training my carrat won't take too long."
msgstr "Надеюсь, тренировка моей морквокрысы не займёт много времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "That's a bit of a setback."
msgstr "Небольшая неудача."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "Perfect!"
msgstr "Идеально!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "I wish it could get quicker faster..."
msgstr "Вот бы она быстрее училась быть быстрой..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "Time to get my carrat up and running."
msgstr "Пришло время запустить мою морквокрысу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "Sigh... now I'll have to build a new one from scratch."
msgstr "Эх... теперь придётся строить новый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm starting to question if I'm spending my time wisely..."
msgstr "Я начинаю сомневаться, разумно ли я трачу своё время..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "It seems to be enjoying itself."
msgstr "Кажется, ей это нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "This shouldn't take too long to piece together."
msgstr "Его постройка не должна отнять много времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "A little milestone."
msgstr "Маленький верстовой столб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "I'll find a place for it sooner or later."
msgstr "Рано или поздно я найду для неё место."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "That's certainly one way to end a race."
msgstr "Безусловно, это один из способов закончить гонку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess the race has to end sometime."
msgstr "Думаю, гонка должна когда-нибудь закончиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "I didn't even need to bend time or space to win!"
msgstr "Мне даже не пришлось ломать пространство-время для победы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "Good job {winner}, but I'll win last time! I mean, next time!"
msgstr "Хорошая работа, {winner}, но в прошлый раз выиграю я! То есть, в следующий!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "Where the race will come to an end."
msgstr "Здесь гонка подойдёт к концу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "Everything has to start somewhere."
msgstr "Всё с чего-то начинается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "The sooner I find a place for it, the sooner we can start."
msgstr "Чем раньше я найду место для неё, тем скорее мы начнём."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "There isn't much left of it."
msgstr "От них мало что осталось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "Incredibly average."
msgstr "Невероятно средняя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "This one might be a winner!"
msgstr "Эта может стать победителем!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "It measures the weight of experience."
msgstr "Они измеряют весомость опыта."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better start setting it up."
msgstr "Стоит начать их постройку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "I guess I should plant them at some point."
msgstr "Думаю, мне стоит их посадить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "They're of a higher quality than the usual seeds."
msgstr "Их качество выше, чем у обычных семян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "Quite the afternoonified anchor."
msgstr "Какой заревой якорь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "I guess it might be useful... but I'd rather not to stay in one place for too long."
msgstr "Полагаю, он может быть полезен... Но я предпочту не стоять на месте слишком долго."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "There's no reversing that."
msgstr "Тут время вспять уже не вернёшь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It looks to be in dire need of charcoal."
msgstr "В остром недостатке угля."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what assortment of knickknacks I can craft here."
msgstr "Посмотрим, какие приблуды у неё в ассортименте."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "Dragonflies are surprisingly well suited for paddling."
msgstr "Драконьи мухи на удивление подготовлены к плаванью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "I certainly hope all this gold doesn't weigh down the boat."
msgstr "Крайне надеюсь, что столько золото не потопит лодку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "I hope I don't forget to add that to the boat."
msgstr "Надеюсь, не забуду установить это на лодку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "Riding a horse that goes nowhere? And yet..."
msgstr "Думаете, я стану скакать на лошади, которая не движется? Может быть..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "There's a time to be brave."
msgstr "Самое время быть храброй."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "That's the end of that."
msgstr "Отбросил свои золочёные копыта."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What does it want now?"
msgstr "Ну а этому-то чего надо?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Satisfied?"
msgstr "Доволен?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "If galloping saves me time, then call me Nellie."
msgstr "Если скачка галопом сэкономит мне время, я могу побыть и кобылой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "Rather old fashioned."
msgstr "Как старомодно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "I wish it would stop glaring at me like that."
msgstr "Мне не нравится, как оно на меня смотрит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "...Maybe someone else will take it."
msgstr "...Может, его возьмёт кто-нибудь ещё."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "This will fill me up for a while."
msgstr "Утолят голод на некоторое время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "More light is always welcome."
msgstr "Света мало не бывает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "Oh botheration, the fire went out!"
msgstr "Вот зараза, огонь погас!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "I suppose I can spare a moment to set it up."
msgstr "Полагаю, можно и уделить минутку, чтобы всё устроить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "More light is always welcome."
msgstr "Света мало не бывает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "Oh botheration, the fire went out!"
msgstr "Вот зараза, огонь погас!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "I suppose I can spare a moment to set it up."
msgstr "Полагаю, можно и уделить минутку, чтобы всё устроить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's not in use at the moment."
msgstr "В данный момент не используется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "What an exhilarating lack of danger!"
msgstr "Какое захватывающее отсутствие опасности!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "I suppose there are worse ways to spend one's time."
msgstr "Полагаю, есть способы и похуже провести своё время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "Oh, well, perhaps just a quick slice or two."
msgstr "Ох, что ж, кусочек или два никому не повредят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "I'd nearly forgotten what \"blue\" tasted like."
msgstr "Я уж и забыла, какой \"синий\" на вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "What a fashionable jelly dessert!"
msgstr "Какой фешенебельно желейный десерт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "What could be better than food on a stick?"
msgstr "Что может быть лучше еды на палке?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "That's an unfortunate turn of events."
msgstr "Какой неудачный поворот событий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "That rabbit looks rather peckish."
msgstr "Этот заяц выглядит изголодавшимся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what trinkets it has to offer?"
msgstr "Интересно, какие безделушки он мне предложит?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "I demand satisfaction!"
msgstr "Я требую удовлетворения!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Who saw that coming? Me."
msgstr "Кто же мог знать, что так будет? Я."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "Who has time to celebrate? Okay, fine."
msgstr "У кого вообще есть время на празднества? Ладно, ладно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "Let's put it up already!"
msgstr "Давайте уже его поставим!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It was just a matter of time."
msgstr "Это было просто вопросом времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "If I recall, it needs monster meat."
msgstr "Если я правильно помню, ему нужно мясо монстра."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Offering made. Let's get on with it, worm!"
msgstr "Подношение сделано. Покончим же с этим, червь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
msgid "I don't remember seeing you up here."
msgstr "Не помню, чтобы видела тебя здесь, наверху."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Oh well, nothing to be done now."
msgstr "Ну что ж, теперь ничего не поделаешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's that time of the duodecennial orbital cycle again."
msgstr "Снова это время двенадцатилетнего орбитального цикла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I suppose there's time to make one little trinket, or two."
msgstr "Думаю, что есть время сделать одну безделушку или две."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "A very particular something or other."
msgstr "Что-то особенное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "I'd best leave well enough alone."
msgstr "Я лучше оставлю его в покое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "Something is making it unhappy."
msgstr "Что-то делает его несчастным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "It wouldn't hurt to plant a few more to keep it company."
msgstr "Не помешало бы посадить ещё несколько растений, чтобы составить ему компанию."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "Do I really have to talk to it?"
msgstr "Серьёзно, мне нужно разговаривать с растением?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "Something around here is stopping it from reaching its full potential."
msgstr "Что-то здесь мешает ему полностью раскрыть свой потенциал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "Oh botheration, did I forget to water it again?"
msgstr "Ой, зараза, неужели я снова забыла его полить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "I'm sure I gave it some fertilizer not too long ago... or maybe I will soon."
msgstr "Я уверена, что не так давно уже удобряла его... или, может, скоро удобрю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I tried to fit too many plants in one spot."
