#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST"
msgid "Now to present my beast for all to see!"
msgstr "А теперь представлю моего зверя на всеобщее обозрение!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "It shall be raised forthwith!"
msgstr "Она будет немедленно поставлена!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
msgid "The competition will be fierce, thus my beast's outfits must be fiercer!"
msgstr "Конкуренция будет серьёзной, поэтому наряды моего зверя должны быть ещё свирепее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM"
msgid "Quickly, the competition awaits!"
msgstr "Быстро, конкурс ждёт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "The lair of our judge."
msgstr "Логово нашего судьи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
msgid "Where to set the battleground of competition..."
msgstr "Где установить поле битвы конкуренции..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Tis naught but ashes now."
msgstr "Теперь это всего лишь пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What dost thou need?"
msgstr "И что тебе нужно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "It irks me to honor a vegetable."
msgstr "Меня раздражает, что это в честь овоща."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "Reduced to cinders."
msgstr "Остался лишь пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "I must ensure my veggie beast is quick-witted!"
msgstr "Я должна убедиться, что моя овощная зверюшка сообразительна!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "You must train harder!"
msgstr "Ты должна тренироваться усерднее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "A trial of wit."
msgstr "Испытание находчивости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "Reduced to cinders."
msgstr "Остался лишь пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "Reflexes are key in battle, and racing!"
msgstr "Рефлексы играют ключевую роль в битве и гонке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "Too slow!"
msgstr "Слишком медленно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "A trial of reflexes."
msgstr "Испытание рефлексов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "Reduced to cinders."
msgstr "Остался лишь пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "We shall test thine speed."
msgstr "Мы испытаем твою скорость."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "Run! Run as if thine life depends on it!"
msgstr "Беги! Беги так, словно от этого зависит твоя жизнь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "A trial of speed."
msgstr "Испытание скорости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "Reduced to cinders."
msgstr "Остался лишь пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "This odd training ground will suffice."
msgstr "Этой странной тренировочной площадки будет вполне достаточно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "Feel the warrior's spirit within you!"
msgstr "Почувствуй в себе дух воина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "A trial of endurance."
msgstr "Испытание на выносливость."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "A waypoint to guide our vegetable beasts."
msgstr "Точка, которая поможет овощной зверюшке найти путь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "A waypoint to guide our vegetable beasts."
msgstr "Точка, которая поможет овощной зверюшке найти путь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Alas, it is no more."
msgstr "Увы, больше нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Who shall claim this noble victory?"
msgstr "Кто будет претендовать на благородную победу?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "The day is won!"
msgstr "День победы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "{winner}'s vegetable champion has seized victory."
msgstr "Овощная зверюшка {winner} выхватила победу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "This shall mark the race's end point."
msgstr "Это обозначит конечную точку гонки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "We shall see which vegetable beast prevails!"
msgstr "Посмотрим, чья овощная зверюшка победит!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "The race cannot commence without it!"
msgstr "Гонка не может начаться без этого!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Naught but ash."
msgstr "Ничего кроме пепла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "You are not yet ready!"
msgstr "Ты ещё не готова!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "This beast will serve me well in the coming battle."
msgstr "Этот зверь хорошо послужит мне в грядущей битве."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "We shall see just how strong my veggie beast truly is."
msgstr "Мы увидим, насколько сильна моя овощная зверюшка на самом деле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "It's time to put my veggie beast to the test."
msgstr "Пришло время проверить мою овощную зверюшку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "I care not for growing vegetables."
msgstr "Меня не волнует выращивание овощей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "The rarity of these non-meats doth not impress me."
msgstr "Редкость этих не мясных продуктов не производит на меня впечатления."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "May it grip the sea floor with all its strength."
msgstr "Да пробьёт же он морское дно своей силой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "I will craft the finest ship in the land!"
msgstr "Я создам величайший корабль на земле!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It is done."
msgstr "С нею покончено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It demands an offering of charcoal."
msgstr "Требует приношение в виде угля."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "A shrine to a fearsome firey beast."
msgstr "Алтарь ужасающему огненному зверю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "I will swipe at the waves with the ferocity of a dragon!"
msgstr "Я пройду через все волны со свирепостью дракона!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Great dragon, steer me to victory!"
msgstr "О великий дракон, приведи меня к победе!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "A vital piece of a glorious vessel."
msgstr "Неотъемлимая часть славного судна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "A fine chance for the younglings to learn the saddle!"
msgstr "Прекрасный шанс для юнцов научиться верховой езде!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "The helm of a dauntless stallion."
msgstr "Шлем бесстрашного жеребца."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "A shame."
msgstr "Позор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What tribute dost thou demand?"
msgstr "Какую дань ты требуешь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Doth this not sate thee?"
msgstr "По сердцу ли тебе моё подношение?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "A swift charger to ride into battle."
msgstr "Я готова ринуться в бой, словно резвый скакун."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "This weapon was wielded by a revered warrior class."
msgstr "Этим оружием владели благородные воины."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "A meaty feast!"
msgstr "Мясной пир!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "'Tis fit only for the beasts."
msgstr "Подойдёт только зверю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "I shall consume it!"
msgstr "Я поглощу это!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "Let us feast by the rabbit's torchlight!"
msgstr "Давайте пировать при свете заячьего факела!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "Its light burns no more."
msgstr "Его свет больше не горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "Let us set the rabbit torch alight!"
msgstr "Давайте зажжем заячий факел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "Let us feast by the rabbit's torchlight!"
msgstr "Давайте пировать при свете заячьего факела!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "Its light burns no more."
msgstr "Его свет больше не горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "Let us set the rabbit torch alight!"
msgstr "Давайте зажжем заячий факел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Who will face me in the field of battle?"
msgstr "Кто встретится со мной на поле битвы?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "There art a battle underway!"
msgstr "Там идет битва!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "A test of might and bravery!"
msgstr "Испытание на силу и храбрость!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "Bah! 'Tis naught but a meat-shaped veggie cake!"
msgstr "Буэ! Это не что иное, как овощной пирог в форме мяса!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "I do not trust whatever lies within."
msgstr "Я не доверяю тому, что лежит внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "A delicious sight indeed!"
msgstr "Действительно, восхитительное зрелище!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "A trio of tasty morsels."
msgstr "Три лакомых кусочка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It must have displeased the gods."
msgstr "Должно быть, это рассердило богов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What should be sacrificed to the beast's maw?"
msgstr "Что следует принести в жертву пасти зверя?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The rabbit seems pleased with my offering."
msgstr "Заяц доволен моим предложением."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "Who dares to face me in the ring?"
msgstr "Кто осмелится встретиться со мной на ринге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Must the gods taketh everything?"
msgstr "Неужели боги должны забрать всё?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope she'll hold."
msgstr "Надеюсь, что он устоит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "Prepare thyself, for revelry doth await."
msgstr "Готовьтесь, ибо ждёт нас славный праздник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "The shrine itself offered to the implacable gods!"
msgstr "Само святилище было принесено в жертву неумолимым богам!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "The worm doth demand a worthy sacrifice."
msgstr "Червь требует достойного подношения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The worm hath been appeased."
msgstr "Червь был удовлетворён."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
msgid "I shall send thee back to the depths, worm!"
msgstr "Я отправлю тебя обратно в глубины, червь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It seems someone offered it a flame. I do not think it liked it."
msgstr "Похоже, кто-то пожертвовал ему пламя. Не думаю что ему понравилось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Perhaps it would enjoy a feather?"
msgstr "Возможно, ему бы хотелось пёрышка?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Let the festive crafting commence!"
msgstr "Да начнётся праздничное ремесло!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "It is an artifact of this realm."
msgstr "Артефакт этого царства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "The foul plant thrives."
msgstr "Мерзкое растение процветает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "Something hinders its growth."
msgstr "Что-то мешает его росту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "Perhaps it needs the company of its kin."
msgstr "Возможно, он нуждается в обществе своих сородичей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "The feeble thing needs conversation to grow? Vikings thrive in stoic silence!"
msgstr "Слабое существо нуждается в разговоре, чтобы расти? Викинги процветают в стоическом молчании!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "It seems to harbor resentment for its weed brethren."
msgstr "Похоже, он затаил обиду на своих собратьев-сорняков."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "It thirsts for water."
msgstr "Он жаждет воды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "You are unhappy with the dirt you have? Do not look to me to help you!"
msgstr "Вы недовольны той землёй, которая у вас есть? Не ждите от меня помощи!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "This small patch of dirt cannot sustain all these non-meats."
msgstr "Этот маленький участок грязи не может выдержать все эти немясные продукты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "It doesn't have what it takes to brave the seasonal elements."
msgstr "У него нет ничего, чтобы противостоять сезонным стихиям."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "It is beset by multiple afflictions."
msgstr "Она страдает от множества недугов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Flames will soon consume it."
msgstr "Пламя вскоре поглотит его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "Too dark, even for battle."
msgstr "Слишком темно даже для битвы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "Bones and all."
msgstr "Одни лишь кости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "It doth taste just like chicken!"
msgstr "На вкус оно совсем как курица!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "The god of the sky has been angered!"
msgstr "Бог неба разозлился!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "Alas! If I'd only grabbed it sooner."
msgstr "Увы! Если бы я только схватила его раньше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "T'were not meant to be a meal."
msgstr "Это не предназначалось для еды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "We shall live to fight another day!"
msgstr "Мы будем жить, чтобы сражаться ещё день!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE"
msgid "I thought I saw that feathered charlatan around here..."
msgstr "Думаю, видел я здесь одного пернатого шарлатана..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN"
msgid "It's vacant."
msgstr "Оно доступно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
msgid "Apparently he has more pressing matters to attend to."
msgstr "Похоже, у него есть более неотложные дела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "It seems we are lacking in participants."
msgstr "Похоже, у нас не достаёт участников."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "This environment is not suitable for a fair game."
msgstr "Это окружение не подходит для честной игры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid "Playtime is over for now."
msgstr "На сегодня игры закончились."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I shall have to find the key."
msgstr "Я должен найти ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "No, that would be ridiculous."
msgstr "Нет, это было бы нелепо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "Finally. It looks like the birds have dispersed."
msgstr "Наконец-то. Похоже, птицы разлетелись."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "Robot junk."
msgstr "Не разбираюсь в робо-хламе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
msgid "Isn't that a job for the little toad?"
msgstr "Разве это не работа для маленькой жабы?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE"
msgid "Willow, your abominable bear is running amok!"
msgstr "Уиллоу, твой отвратительный медведь взбесился!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW"
msgid "If I'm going to humiliate myself, I can at least do it properly."
msgstr "Если я собираюсь унизить себя, то по крайней мере можно сделать это должным образом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER"
msgid "That's too stiff a drink."
msgstr "Этот напиток слишком крепкий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW"
msgid "He's attending to some other business, presently."
msgstr "В данный момент он занят другими делами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I must wait and regain my strength."
msgstr "Мне следует подождать и восстановить силы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "No need to do it twice."
msgstr "Нет необходимости делать это дважды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "I can't do that while it's covered in moon glass."
msgstr "Я не могу этого сделать, пока он покрыт лунным стеклом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION"
msgid "I have to wait?!"
msgstr "Я? Ждать?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "One pet is enough responsibility."
msgstr "Одного питомца вполне достаточно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "Even with my long arms, I still can't reach."
msgstr "Даже с моими длинными руками, всё равно не достаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON"
msgid "I've already recruited a ticoon."
msgstr "Я уже нанял енототигра."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE"
msgid "Those blasted things move too fast!"
msgstr "Эти проклятые штуки двигаются слишком быстро!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
msgid "Keep those flames away from my eyebrows!"
msgstr "Держите это пламя подальше от моих бровей!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's at it already."
msgstr "Кто-то уже ей занят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_MAX_SANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_MAX_SANITY"
msgid "I fear my mind can't take the strain..."
msgstr "Не могу, голова раскалывается..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_SPELLBOOK.NO_TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_SPELLBOOK.NO_TOPHAT"
msgid "I'll need a top hat for this trick to work."
msgstr "Мне понадобится цилиндр, чтобы фокус сработал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "Oh. There go all my good pocket squares."
msgstr "Ох. Вся моя коллекция пропала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "How could you improve on perfection?"
msgstr "Ну как можно улучить то, что и так идеально?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "They're in much more dire need of it."
msgstr "Им намного нужнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT"
msgid "I think you're forgetting something, pal..."
msgstr "Мне кажется, ты кое-что забыл, приятель..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR"
msgid "There's nothing for me to work with."
msgstr "Мне не с чем работать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL"
msgid "Full charge!"
msgstr "Заряд полон!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE"
msgid "Who left it uncharged?"
msgstr "Кто оставил его незаряженным?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "It's not worth my time."
msgstr "Это не стоит того времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "This one is insignificant in comparison."
msgstr "В сравнении с остальними, этот ничтожен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "Well I need something to build with."
msgstr "Хорошо, мне нужно что-то для постройки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "I don't like sharing."
msgstr "Я не люблю делиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "It needs completely different plans."
msgstr "Ему нужны совершенно другие чертежи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "That's the wrong part."
msgstr "Это неправильная часть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY"
msgid "I'll give an offering once the imminent danger has passed."
msgstr "Я сделаю подношение, как только пройдёт неминуемая опасность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing ever goes as planned."
msgstr "Ничто никогда не идёт по плану."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "Hmph. You're adding too much salt."
msgstr "Хм-м-м. Ты сыпешь слишком много соли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "I must get closer."
msgstr "Следует подойти ближе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT"
msgid "There's a stupid hat in the way."
msgstr "Мне мешает какая-то глупая шляпа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's hogging it."
msgstr "Кто-то уже им занят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING"
msgid "It's about to melt."
msgstr "Он сейчас растает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH"
msgid "I'm not stacking it any higher."
msgstr "Выше я его уже не сделаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE"
msgid "Ugh, empty! I'll do it later."
msgstr "Эх, пусто! Сделаю это позже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "I'd rather not lay my hands on a hot stove, thank you very much."
msgstr "Я предпочту не трогать горячий казан, спасибо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "It's occupied."
msgstr "Оккупировано."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "First I must remove its contents."
msgstr "Сначала нужно убрать то, что лежит внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED"
msgid "Quit moving!"
msgstr "Да стой ты!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "My memory isn't good enough to draw from it."
msgstr "Моя память недостаточно хороша, чтобы рисовать из головы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "Why must the plants be so picky?"
msgstr "Почему растения должны быть такими придирчивыми?"

