msgstr "Уи-и-и-и-и... АЙ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID"
msgid "Let's get out of here!"
msgstr "Бежим отсюда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
