msgstr "Мы поймали его!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
