#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE"
