#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING"
