msgstr "Примитивное ювелирное изделие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "Some grass cuttings."
msgstr "Немного сорванной травы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "It may be a suitable plaything for the children, if they behave themselves."
msgstr "Это может быть подходящей игрушкой для детей, если они будут хорошо себя вести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "This won't last long."
msgstr "Его на долго не хватит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Some rush cuttings."
msgstr "Отменно сбалансированные клёцки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Some smoothed rock slabs."
msgstr "Несколько обтёсанных каменных плит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "This creature has terrible manners."
msgstr "У этого существа ужасные манеры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "My, how did it end up in this state?"
msgstr "Боже, как же всё дошло до такого состояния?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "The pitiful beast is pinned beneath this pile of debris."
msgstr "Жалкий зверь придавлен под горой отходов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "The creature appears calm for now. Best not aggravate it."
msgstr "Существо не выглядит агрессивным в данный момент. Лучше его не провоцировать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "Someone should teach this brute some manners."
msgstr "Кому-то нужно припадать этому дикарю пару уроков хороших манер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "It will require much greater force than I can muster to break it."
msgstr "Потребуется гораздо большая сила, чтобы сломать её."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "How odd... the marble appears to be encasing something."
msgstr "Как странно... Кажется, что мрамор что-то скрывает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "I'm not sure that's good to eat."
msgstr "Я не уверена, что это съедобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "What curious skeletal structures."
msgstr "Какие любопытные скелетные структуры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "Дерево горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Обуглившееся дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Оно было срублено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Fagales of some kind. It bears fruit when fully grown."
msgstr "Что-то вроде Fagales. Приносит плоды, когда достигает зрелости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "That is no tree I've seen before!"
msgstr "Такого дерева я ещё не видела!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "Do we have enough players for Bridge?"
msgstr "Хватит ли у нас игроков для бриджа?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "I suppose it's pretty, but it doesn't do much."
msgstr "Я полагаю, это красиво, но толку от этого немного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "Ah, could use a doily, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr "Ах, не помешала бы газета, верно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "The more light to read by the better, in my opinion."
msgstr "На мой взгляд, чем больше света для чтения, тем лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's pleasant to see a little decor out here."
msgstr "Приятно видеть здесь немного декора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It is Maxwell's turn to procure bulbs. I've it written down right here."
msgstr "Сейчас очередь Максвелла менять лампочки. У меня всё записано."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "A pity. Shall we find replacements?"
msgstr "Какая жалость. Найдём же замену?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "Now I can read my books at night."
msgstr "Теперь я могу читать книги по ночам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure. Why not?"
msgstr "Конечно. Почему бы и нет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "All art begins with a blank page."
msgstr "Всё искусство начинается с чистого листа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "A decent resemblance."
msgstr "Приличное сходство."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Its antler has grown in for winter."
msgstr "Его рог вырос зимой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "It has shed its antler for the warmer months."
msgstr "Он сбрасывает свои рога на период тёплых месяцев."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "Laurasiatheria!"
msgstr "Laurasiatheria!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "It's the safest course of action."
msgstr "Это самое безопасное решение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It might be prudent to dispose of the body."
msgstr "Возможно, было бы благоразумно избавиться от тела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Goodness! Something is reanimating the body!"
msgstr "Боже мой! Что-то оживляет тело!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "An implement that conditions the air, or ambient-temperature-reduction-device for short."
msgstr "Приспособление для кондиционирования воздуха, или сокращенно устройство для снижения температуры окружающей среды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "It is rendered useless without the eye of that beast."
msgstr "Оно бесполезно без ока этого зверя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "It should be a simple matter to construct it."
msgstr "Сконструировать его должно быть несложно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "I feel a vague sense of accomplishment."
msgstr "У меня смутное чувство выполненного долга."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "It looks like a key, but it's quite brittle."
msgstr "Это похоже на ключ, но он довольно хрупкий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "The poor creature has been forcibly fused to a magic gem."
msgstr "Бедное существо насильно слилось с магическим камнем."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "A tuft of a graminoid."
msgstr "Срез представителя травообразных."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Much more effective than reading glasses."
msgstr "Гораздо эффективнее, чем очки для чтения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT"
msgid "It will help me be rid of excess moisture."
msgstr "Она поможет мне избавиться от лишней влаги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED"
msgid "This should keep me comfortably dry."
msgstr "Теперь я точно не промокну."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "Unhygienic!"
msgstr "Негигиенично!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "The dial is moving faintly."
msgstr "Стрелка лишь слегка колеблется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a magitechnical homing device."
msgstr "Это магически-техническое устройство наведения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "Here we are!"
msgstr "Итак, мы на месте!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "This is definitely the right track."
msgstr "Это, безусловно, правильный путь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Must be getting close."
msgstr "Должно быть, уже близко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It will need some work before it can function."
msgstr "Над этим ещё нужно посидеть, чтобы заработало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "It simply needs a key now."
msgstr "Просто нужен ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "Ah. The beauty of functionality."
msgstr "Ах. Красота функциональности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "This rod could be useful!"
msgstr "Это устройство может оказаться полезным!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT"
msgid "Some essential materials for constructing a wharf."
msgstr "Некоторые необходимые материалы для строительства причала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM"
msgid "Unnecessary for a floating dock, but they do have a pleasant appearance."
msgstr "Ненужные для плавучего дока, но они действительно имеют приятный внешний вид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "A bit childish for my tastes."
msgstr "Немного по-детски, как по мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT"
msgid "It would make sense to construct this near the water."
msgstr "Было бы логично поставить её возле воды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK"
msgid "Everything I need has been conveniently collected into a singular package."
msgstr "Всё что мне было нужно, удобно упаковано в единую оболочку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "The longer the dragon, the better the luck."
msgstr "Чем длинее дракон, тем лучше удача."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD"
msgid "I do like fresh greens."
msgstr "Я люблю свежую зелень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "It's some kind of mythical variant of a Diptera."
msgstr "Это какой-то мифический вариант Diptera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Scales! Scales are the winner!"
msgstr "Чешуйки! Чешуйки побеждают!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "A fireproof chest with an impossibly expansive interior."
msgstr "Противопожарный сундук с невозможно экспансивным пространством."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "A very efficient, magically powered furnace."
msgstr "Весьма эффективная, волшебная печь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "Hm, that was an interesting choice of alteration."
msgstr "Хм, это был интересный выбор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "The magic of the two gems keeps it burning at maximum strength."
msgstr "Магия двух камней держит жар на максимуме возможностей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "It is burning at half strength, presently."
msgstr "Горит вполсилы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "Hylocereus undatus, or pitahaya blanca."
msgstr "Hylocereus undatus, или pitahaya blanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "Pleasantly prepared pitahaya blanca."
msgstr "Недурственно приготовленная pitahaya blanca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "The result of proper research, planning and care."
msgstr "Результат правильного исследования, планирования и ухода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "Они не вырастут, если их не посадить, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "This is the head to the dragon costume."
msgstr "Это голова для костюма дракона."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "I do love a nice fruit pie."
msgstr "Я люблю хороший фруктовый пирог."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "This is the back of the dragon costume."
msgstr "Это задняя часть костюма дракона."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "Scales from an insect? Unheard of!"
msgstr "Чешуя у насекомых? Неслыханно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE"
msgid "Metamorphic, if I'm not mistaken."
msgstr "Метаморфический, если я не ошибаюсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT"
msgid "Unfortunately, the material seems to have adverse affects on the mind."
msgstr "К счастью, этот материал не оказывает негативного воздействия на психику."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK"
msgid "Its source must lie even deeper underground."
msgstr "Должно быть его источник находится ещё глубже под землёй."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG"
msgid "A naturally buoyant material."
msgstr "Естественный плавучий материал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "Дерево горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Carbonized, through and through."
msgstr "Насквозь обуглившаяся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Little of use remains."
msgstr "От него мало что осталось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A new material may be of some use to us."
msgstr "Новый материал может нам пригодиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "A leg of poultry."
msgstr "Ножка птицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "Not terribly healthy, but my is it delicious!"
msgstr "Не слишком полезно, но довольно вкусно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH"
msgid "The fruit is remarkably similar to our own subterranean strain."
msgstr "Плоды удивительно похожи на наш собственный подземный сорт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Здесь нужна плодородная почва для роста."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Нужно посадить в землю, чтобы росло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Здесь нужна плодородная почва для роста."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Здесь нужна плодородная почва для роста."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "A variation of the common Typha latifolia, perhaps?"
msgstr "Возможно, разновидность обыкновенного Typha latifolia?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "It requires soil to grow."
msgstr "Здесь нужна плодородная почва для роста."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH"
msgid "It is no longer a danger."
msgstr "Она больше не представляет опасности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Немного физических упражнений могут быть весьма полезны для здоровья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM"
msgid "My, it's ice-cold to the touch!"
msgstr "Боже, она ледяная на ощупь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Немного физических упражнений могут быть весьма полезны для здоровья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Немного физических упражнений могут быть весьма полезны для здоровья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT"
msgid "An interesting combination of exercise and temperature regulation."
msgstr "Интересное сочетание упражнений и терморегуляции."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE"
msgid "A bit of exercise can be quite beneficial to one's health."
msgstr "Немного физических упражнений могут быть весьма полезны для здоровья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM"
msgid "Careful dear, that looks suspiciously combustible."
msgstr "Осторожно, дорогуша, она выглядит подозрительно горючей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "Aha, the Durio zibethinus. It really does reek."
msgstr "Ага. Durio zibethinus. Он действительно дурно пахнет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking this certainly did not improve its odor."
msgstr "К сожалению готовка не устраняет его запах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Oh, our diminutive green friend will be thrilled!"
msgstr "О, наша маленькая зелёная подруга будет в восторге!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "Они не вырастут, если их не посадить, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE"
msgid "Perhaps there's a creature around here that could metabolize this."
msgstr "Возможно, где-то здесь есть существо, которое могло бы это переварить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH"
msgid "I would have been quite pleased to have one helping me in the library."
msgstr "Было бы неплохо, если бы один такой помогал мне в библиотеке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN"
msgid "It seems a chemical reaction within the bodies of these creatures creates Thulecite."
msgstr "По-видимому, химическая реакция внутри тел этих существ создаёт тулецит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "Poor Leporidae. At least it's warm."
msgstr "Бедные Leporidae. По крайней мере, они греют."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "It's an eel."
msgstr "Это угорь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "This eel has been cooked."
msgstr "Этот угорь был приготовлен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "A nightshade. Solanum melongena, specifically."
msgstr "Баклажан или Solanum melongena, если быть точнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "For your enjoyment: Braised Solanum melongena."
msgstr "Наслаждайтесь: Тушёный Solanum melongena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A particularly resplendent Solanum melongena."
msgstr "Особенно великолепный Solanum melongena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "Они не вырастут, если их не посадить, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER"
msgid "What a pretty elixir organizer!"
msgstr "Какое милое хранилище для эликсиров!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT"
msgid "Nothing like some unnatural fire to warm yourself with on a chilly day."
msgstr "Нет ничего лучше какого-нибудь неестественного огня, у которого можно согреться в холодный день."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, such as it is."
msgstr "Ну, как есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Ah, could use a doily, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr "Ох, можно было бы хоть салфетку поставить. Я же говорила?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "The more light to read by the better, in my opinion."
msgstr "Чем светлее, тем лучше читать, я считаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's pleasant to see a little decor out here."
msgstr "Приятно увидеть немного декора здесь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It is Maxwell's turn to procure bulbs. I've it written down right here."
msgstr "Сейчас очередь Максвелла менять лампочки. У меня всё записано."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "A pity. Shall we find replacements?"
msgstr "Жалко. Мы найдём замену?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "Дерево горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Обуглившееся дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Оно было срублено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A generically coniferous tree."
msgstr "Обобщённо говоря, это хвойное дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "Дерево горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "Обуглившееся дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "Оно было срублено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "This genus seems to lack reproductive capabilities."
msgstr "Этот подвид, похоже, имеет плохие репродуктивные свойства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "The cornea must be quite water-repellent."
msgstr "Роговица, должно быть, неплохо отталкивает воду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "I doubt that they make my prescription in this size."
msgstr "Я сомневаюсь, что он был подойдёт моим рекомендациям по размеру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Oculus dexter or oculus sinister, I wonder? I have a suspicion it's the latter."
msgstr "Интересно, oculus dexter или oculus sinister? Подозреваю, что второе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "I'm fascinated, but now is not the time to study you."
msgstr "Я заворожена, но сейчас не время изучать тебя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "An eyeball... embryo? These creatures are quite perplexing."
msgstr "Глазной... эмбрион? Эти существа довольно сложные."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "I believe they are controlled by the larger plant."
msgstr "Я думаю, ими управляет вот та мясистая часть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "The magic of the two beasts has been concentrated by the Thulecite."
msgstr "Магия двух зверей была совмещена с помощью тулецита."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "I'll need to place this."
msgstr "Мне нужно будет это куда-нибудь установить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "It shan't grow a crop again."
msgstr "Она больше не будет приносить урожай."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "A small cultivated patch of ground."
msgstr "Небольшой окультуренный участок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "The plants are extracting minerals from the ground."
msgstr "Растения получают полезные минералы из земли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "It has been rendered infertile for lack of nutrients."
msgstr "Она не будет приносить урожай из-за отсутствия питательных веществ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "Humans have cultivated crops since Neolithic times."
msgstr "Люди возделывали зерновые культуры ещё со времен неолита."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "What an unfortunate turn of events!"
msgstr "Какой неудачный поворот событий!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "I daresay that's ready to harvest."
msgstr "Осмелюсь сказать, что все готово к сбору урожая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How splendid!"
msgstr "Как прекрасно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "Weeds have no place in the garden."
msgstr "Сорнякам не место в огороде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "Of the kingdom Plantae."
msgstr "Из царства Планта."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "It's coming along."
msgstr "Растёт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "I detest the sight of spoiled food!"
msgstr "Я не переношу вид испорченной еды!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How terrible to see it all go to waste!"
msgstr "Как ужасно видеть, что всё пропадает даром!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "It takes patience to grow crops from seed."
msgstr "Чтобы вырастить урожай из семян, требуется терпение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "How very efficient!"
msgstr "Это эффективно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "I'd best find a suitable spot for my garden."
msgstr "Мне лучше найти подходящее место для моего огорода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Oh no you don't! Out of my garden!"
msgstr "О нет, нет! Вон из моего огорода!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "This will induce quite an airflow!"
msgstr "Это обеспечит хоть какое-то движение воздуха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "Not quite the genuine article, but it might fool some birds."
msgstr "Не гениально, но некоторые птицы клюнут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "Oh, how I missed proper writing implements!"
msgstr "Ох, как же я скучала по письменным принадлежностям!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "Feather of Canaria."
msgstr "Перо Canaria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "Feather of Corvus. Or Alcidae?"
msgstr "Перо Corvus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "Feather of Cardinalis."
msgstr "Перо Cardinalis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "It looks like a feather of Cardinalis, but white."
msgstr "Выглядит как перо Cardinalis, только белое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "Poor girl."
msgstr "Бедная девочка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "A simply constructed fence."
msgstr "Простой построенный забор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC"
msgid "The post is not conducting a current at the moment."
msgstr "Столб пока не проводит электричество."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED"
msgid "The post is conducting a current just strong enough to deter uninsulated creatures."
msgstr "Столбы создают электрическое поле, достаточное для удержания не изолированных существ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM"
msgid "This is an electric fence post and it must be planted before it can be used."
msgstr "Чтобы столб электрического ограждения заработал, его нужно установить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "That is a wooden gate."
msgstr "Это деревянные ворота."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "All the components for a wooden gate."
msgstr "Все компоненты для деревянных ворот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "All the components for a wooden fence."
msgstr "Все компоненты для деревянного забора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "Unpleasant to the eye, but I suppose practicality outweighs aesthetics."
msgstr "Не совсем приятный глазу, но, полагаю, практичность перевешивает эстетику."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "Sometimes sharpness is necessary to keep things aligned and orderly."
msgstr "Иногда острота необходима для того, чтобы всё было выровнено и упорядочено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "A bucket of animal feces. Pungent."
msgstr "Ведро фекалий животных. Пикантно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "I'm unfamiliar with the origins of this dish."
msgstr "Я не знакома с происхождением этого блюда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It features quite an eclectic combination of colors."
msgstr "Он отличается довольно эклектичным сочетанием цветов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "I do enjoy a nice ripe fig."
msgstr "Мне правда нравятся хорошие спелые фиги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "An unexpected, but not unpleasant combination."
msgstr "Неожиданная, но не неприятная комбинация."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "I suppose this is the next logical step after meat on a stick."
msgstr "Похоже, это следующий логический шаг после мяса на ветке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking it brings out more of the flavor."
msgstr "Приготовление придаёт ей больше вкуса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "Someone experienced with magic ought to wield this. Like myself!"
msgstr "Кто знаком с магией, должен обладать этим. Как я!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "A little too noisy for my liking."
msgstr "Как по мне, слишком шумно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "They disperse when I approach."
msgstr "Они прячутся при моём приближении."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "Their bioluminescent properties might prove useful."
msgstr "Их биолюминесцентные свойства могут оказаться полезными."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "That hound is more dangerous than the others."
msgstr "Эта собака опаснее, чем остальные."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "Dastardly things."
msgstr "Подлые сорняки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED"
msgid "The drying process enhances the aroma."
msgstr "В процессе сушки аромат усиливается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "A firestorm can be unleashed with but a few strokes of a writer's pen."
msgstr "Огненный шторм может быть вызван всего несколькими росчерками писательского пера."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "The fire has almost self-extinguished."
msgstr "Этот костёр почти полностью выгорел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "A fire pit."
msgstr "Кострище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is burning at an alarming rate."
msgstr "Меня тревожит интенсивность горения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire could use some more fuel."
msgstr "Огню не помешало бы ещё немного топлива."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "A perfectly average fire."
msgstr "Совершенно обычный костёр."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "It can be re-lit."
msgstr "Можно зажечь повторно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "Some kind of fire-throwing contraption."
msgstr "Разновидность огнеметательного приспособления."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Fuel's getting low."
msgstr "Топливо кончается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "Не на что здесь смотреть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "Pitch that ice!"
msgstr "Подкинь-ка льда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Some kind of whitefish, I believe."
msgstr "Какая-то разновидность белой рыбы, я полагаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "The sea is a treasure trove of survival resources."
msgstr "Море - это сокровищница ресурсов для выживания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "I've read all about fishing. It should be a snap."
msgstr "Я прочитала всё о рыбалке. Это должно быть несложно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "An odorous slab of fish meat."
msgstr "Пахнущий кусок рыбного мяса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Beautifully grilled."
msgstr "С хрустящей корочкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Salty, yet satisfying."
msgstr "Солёное и сытное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "Fish flesh."
msgstr "Рыбная плоть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "A small bit of nourishment."
msgstr "Небольшой кусочек пропитания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED"
msgid "Salty, yet satisfying."
msgstr "Солёное и сытное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "Give me some tartar sauce and I'm in heaven."
msgstr "Дай мне немного соуса тартар, и я на небесах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Personally I relish a spot of spice on my fish."
msgstr "Лично я наслаждаюсь специями на этой рыбке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "A clever contraption to keep seafood fresh."
msgstr "Хитроумное приспособление для сохранения свежести морепродуктов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Beautifully grilled."
msgstr "С хрустящей корочкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "A hard nodule of quartz."
msgstr "Твёрдая кварцевая порода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED"
msgid "Now that the thermal lift is gone, it descended accordingly."
msgstr "Тепловой подъем исчез, и фонарь, соответственно, снизился."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing magical here. It's flotation is merely due to hot air being less dense than the surrounding atmosphere."
msgstr "Никакой магии в этом нет. Он летает благодаря тому, что горячий воздух менее плотный, чем окружающая атмосфера."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD"
msgid "Deployment consists simply of allowing it to ascend upon release."
msgstr "Смысл состоит в том, чтобы позволить ему взлететь после того, как его отпустили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "A passive deployment flotation device. I approve."
msgstr "Индивидуальное спасательное средство на воде. Одобряю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a wildflower. I'm unfamiliar with the species."
msgstr "Это полевой цветок. Я не знакома с их разновидностями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Ah, a Rosa Macdub... what's it doing out here?"
msgstr "А, Rosa Macdub... как она здесь очутилась?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "How celebratory."
msgstr "Чересчур празднично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "Plenty of nutrients!"
msgstr "Множество питательных веществ!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "You could read by that light."
msgstr "С этим светом и читать можно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED"
msgid "It will not survive in these conditions."
msgstr "Он не выживет в таких условиях."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "It's not often one sees a flower with such a powerful aura."
msgstr "Нечасто увидишь цветок с такой мощной аурой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "This flower lacks the essentials for growth."
msgstr "Этому цветку не хватает жизненно необходимых вещей для роста."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "These may have some nutritional value."
msgstr "Они могут иметь некоторую питательную ценность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED"
msgid "The drying process enhances the aroma."
msgstr "В процессе сушки аромат усиливается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "Protective gear for full-contact endeavors."
msgstr "Защитное снаряжение для фулл-контактных действий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "This strain can be used to brew a rather pleasant herbal tea."
msgstr "Этот сорт можно использовать для заваривания довольно приятного травяного чая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED"
msgid "The drying process enhances the aroma."
msgstr "В процессе сушки аромат усиливается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It seems rather senseless to attempt to make a beefalo appear dignified."
msgstr "Довольно бессмысленно пытаться заставить бифало выглядеть достойно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "Hardened remains preserved by taphonomic processes."
msgstr "Закалённые останки, сохранённые благодаря процессу тафономии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "Oh! A specimen fit for a museum!"
msgstr "О! Этот образец подойдёт для музея!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "Paleontological incompetence has produced a sad excuse for a creature."
msgstr "На языке палеонтологии, жизнь этого существа закончилась весьма грустно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "There are pieces of the skeleton still yet to be assembled."
msgstr "Части скелета всё ещё не собраны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES"
msgid "Sticky fingers will ensue."
msgstr "Липкие пальцы обеспечены."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY"
msgid "This one appears to be of a different, more agreeable subspecies."
msgstr "Этот, по-видимому, принадлежит к другому, более дружелюбному подвиду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "Considered a delicacy in some countries."
msgstr "В некоторых странах считается деликатесом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "A amphibian tetrapod."
msgstr "Четвероногое земноводное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleeping."
msgstr "Спит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL"
msgid "I'll happily volunteer to taste-test."
msgstr "Я с радостью стану добровольцем протестировать вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "It was an interesting choice to serve it as a sandwich."
msgstr "Интересная вариация подачи такого блюда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "They're still twitching a bit."
msgstr "Они ещё подёргиваются."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "Not unlike a chicken wing."
msgstr "Почти не отличить от куриного крылышка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON"
msgid "It has quite a unique flavor."
msgstr "Довольно уникальный вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI"
msgid "This would pair nicely with a short book."
msgstr "Он бы хорошо подошёл к короткой книге."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "Plant and animal have merged into one in this specimen."
msgstr "Растение и животное слились в одно в этом образце."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "It does smell quite delicious."
msgstr "Она довольно хорошо пахнет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's in a deep sleep."
msgstr "Находится в фазе глубокого сна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY"
msgid "Those pests are making quite the nuisance of themselves."
msgstr "Эти вредители сами по себе доставляют немало хлопот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT"
msgid "It seems that I can exert some level of control over these insects with this."
msgstr "Кажется, с помощью этого я могу осуществлять некоторый контроль над этими насекомыми."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "What a nice selection of fruit!"
msgstr "Какое приятное ассорти!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Fur from a Bearger."
msgstr "Мех Медведя-барсука."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING"
msgid "It is reminiscent of the parasitic shadows we encountered before."
msgstr "Это напоминает те тени-паразиты, с которыми мы сталкивались раньше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB"
msgid "Its body is highly volatile."
msgstr "Его тело очень изменчиво."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "Completely petrified as a result of lunar exposure."
msgstr "Полностью окаменели в результате лунного воздействия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "Lunar light catalyzes a strange reaction in its skin."
msgstr "Лунный свет катализирует странную реакцию на её шкуре."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "Allium sativum, a close relative of Allium cepa."
msgstr "Allium sativum, близкий родственник Allium cepa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Roast Allium sativum."
msgstr "Жареный Allium sativum."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How fascinating, it seems to have grown into a braided configuration all on its own!"
msgstr "Как увлекательно, кажется, что он вырос в плетеную конфигурацию сам по себе!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "Они не вырастут, если их не посадить, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "Ah! A classic Spanish cuisine."
msgstr "Ах! Классическая испанская кухня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "Various cogs and wheels."
msgstr "Винтики и шестерёнки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC"
msgid "Icker is a highly adhesive gelatinous substance."
msgstr "Бякер - высоко адгезивная желатиновая субстанция."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER"
msgid "Someone is trapped inside and can't get out."
msgstr "Кто-то застрял внутри и не может выбраться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "There appears to be an object inside."
msgstr "Судя по всему, внутри находится объект."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE"
msgid "This will do nicely."
msgstr "Это будет очень кстати."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL"
msgid "The contents are perfectly safe to consume."
msgstr "Содержимое совершенно безопасно для употребления."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "The dark gelatinous substance, colloquially known as Icker, will preserve our food items."
msgstr "Тёмная желатиновая субстанция, известная в просторечии как \\"бякер\\", сохранит свежесть нашей еды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT"
msgid "A simple food preservation method."
msgstr "Простой способ консервирования еды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "These hold gems."
msgstr "Они удерживают кристаллы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "What a strange effect."
msgstr "Какой странный эффект."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "A necessary precaution."
msgstr "Необходимая предосторожность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It appears to be deceased."
msgstr "Судя по всему, он мёртв."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It is reviving, unfortunately."
msgstr "К сожалению, он оживает вновь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT"
msgid "They are the projections of something stronger."
msgstr "Они являются проекциями чего-то более сильного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED"
msgid "It contains an entity."
msgstr "Сущность заперта внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is quite empty."
msgstr "Ничего нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD"
msgid "They possess higher defensive capabilities than their smaller counterparts."
msgstr "Они обладают более высокими защитными возможностями, чем их более мелкие собратья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED"
msgid "They have evolved into a more hostile form."
msgstr "Они обрели более враждебную форму."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "It must be fake. I don't believe it."
msgstr "Я отказываюсь верить. Оно не настоящее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER"
msgid "I'm afraid I'm unfamiliar with this genus."
msgstr "Боюсь, я незнакома с этим видом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT"
msgid "It allows one to imbibe like the dead."
msgstr "Он позволяет живому выпивать то, что предназначено для мёртвых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Умница!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Маркировка цветом и этикеткой. Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "Oh goodness, how lovely!"
msgstr "О, боже, как мило!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "Wrapping presents is soothing work, isn't it?"
msgstr "Обертывание подарков - это успокаивающая работа, не так ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "Reminds me of a story I know."
msgstr "Это напоминает мне одну историю, которую я знаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "If it would sit still long enough, I could classify it."
msgstr "Если бы он стоял на месте достаточно долго, я бы могла классифицировать его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Canis Festivus."
msgstr "Canis Festivus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "I always loved glass sculptures."
msgstr "Мне всегда нравились стеклянные скульптуры."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "I like to get straight to the point."
msgstr "Люблю сразу переходить к делу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "Careful, it's sharp."
msgstr "Осторожно, она острая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "A bizarre specimen of the insecta class."
msgstr "Причудливый представитель класса насекомых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "It appears to be resting."
msgstr "Похоже, он отдыхает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "It's gone gray, but it's still dripping."
msgstr "Он увял, но по-прежнему пропитан слизью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's dripping with goo."
msgstr "Пропитан слизью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "It appears to be quite volatile."
msgstr "Кажется, оно очень нестабильно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "The pennons of that strange specimen."
msgstr "Крылья странного экземпляра."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "A brand new recipe I see. Marvelous!"
msgstr "Совершенно новый рецепт, как я вижу. Замечательно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "Serves you right."
msgstr "Так тебе и надо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "I'm sure it will grow back in time, dear."
msgstr "Я уверена, что со временем он снова вырастет, дорогой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "His manners have improved considerably."
msgstr "Его манеры значительно улучшились."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "It appears to be a variation of the Monodon monoceros."
msgstr "Похоже, он один из разновидностей Monodon monoceros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "A gnarwail's \"horn\" is actually a tooth, you know."
msgstr "А знали вы, что \"рог\" нарвала на самом деле зуб?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "Tantalizing!"
msgstr "Экстравагантно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "I can't imagine these improving visibility."
msgstr "Я не могу представить, как они улучшают видимость."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this chops."
msgstr "Один из самых мягких металлов, но давай посмотрим, как он будет рубить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this mines."
msgstr "Один из самых мягких металлов, но давай посмотрим, как он будет колоть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this tills."
msgstr "Один из самых мягких металлов, но давай посмотрим, как он будет пахать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this digs."
msgstr "Один из самых мягких металлов, но давай посмотрим, как он будет копать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how it does in the garden."
msgstr "Самый податливый из металлов, но давайте посмотрим, как он будет работать в огороде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "A small lump of gold. Atomic number 79."
msgstr "Небольшой кусок золота. Атомный номер 79."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "Soft body down! It makes me wish I could sleep."
msgstr "Такое мягкое! Я будто сплю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "It needs poop."
msgstr "Оно нуждается в удобрении."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Combustion!"
msgstr "Реакция окисления!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "It's afflicted with an agrarian disease beyond my curing."
msgstr "Выглядит болезненным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Hm... There are spots of discoloration here."
msgstr "Хм... Тут какие-то пятна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "A cluster graminoid stalks."
msgstr "Скопление травянистых стеблей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "I think it will grow back."
msgstr "Я думаю что она вырастет снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "It can't survive in this hot climate."
msgstr "Ей не выжить в таком жарком климате."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "It appears docile enough."
msgstr "Выглядит достаточно послушным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It appears to be infected by some unknown pathogen."
msgstr "Кажется, она инфицирована неизвестным патогеном."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "I've never encountered this species before. Seems harmless."
msgstr "Я никогда не сталкивалась с этим видом ранее. Выглядит безобидно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "A dainty parasol that will provide moderate protection."
msgstr "Изящный зонт, который обеспечит немного защиты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "The vessel is empty."
msgstr "Сосуд пуст."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "It contains a disembodied spirit."
msgstr "В нём содержится бестелесный дух."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "Oh my, it's a bit rich for me."
msgstr "Божечки, она слишком густая для меня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "Works almost as a magical binding agent."
msgstr "Работает почти как магическая связь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "Chromium impurities have colored this gem green."
msgstr "Этот камень зелёный из-за примесей хрома."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "That should help us keep our bearings."
msgstr "Это нам поможет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "It appears to rewind time on an object."
msgstr "Он как будто отматывает время, по отношению к конкретному объекту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Seems edible, though it may not be totally sane to consume it."
msgstr "Выглядит съедобно, но возможно не стоит это употреблять."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Chemistry has altered it."
msgstr "Химия изменила его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a fungus."
msgstr "Это гриб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It is dormant this time of day."
msgstr "Они находятся в состоянии покоя в это время дня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It requires hydration before it can fruit again."
msgstr "Ему нужна влага, чтобы вырасти снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "How interesting, it seems to be forming moon glass stalagmites."
msgstr "Как интересно, кажется, образуются лунные стеклянные сталагмиты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "How interesting, it seems to be forming moon glass stalagmites."
msgstr "Как интересно, кажется, образуются лунные стеклянные сталагмиты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "I always made guacamole for science day at the library."
msgstr "Я всегда делаю гуакамоле на День науки в библиотеке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "More metabolic byproduct."
msgstr "Опять отходы метаболизма."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Knowledge is power!"
msgstr "Знание - сила!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Remember to eat in moderation, children."
msgstr "Помните, дети, это нельзя есть в больших количествах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "How darling!"
msgstr "Как мило!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "I fear I've a terrible weakness for a spot of chocolate."
msgstr "Боюсь, мне станет плохо от шоколада."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "The candy itself is quite pleasant, if unappealing in appearance."
msgstr "Сама конфета довольно приятна, если она непривлекательна по внешнему виду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "There will be some sore jaws in the morning, I imagine."
msgstr "Полагаю, утром будет болеть челюсть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "A delightful ten on the Scoville scale."
msgstr "Восхитительная десятка по шкале Сковилла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Delightfully colored kernels of high fructose corn syrup."
msgstr "Восхитительные цветные конфеты, обогащённые фруктозой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Hmm, well, at least there's a healthy option on the table."
msgstr "Хмм, по-крайней мере, есть и более полезные варианты такой кукурузы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "I was always a fan of black licorice, myself."
msgstr "Я всегда была поклонником чёрной лакрицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "It almost seems a shame to eat them."
msgstr "Почти стыдно это съедать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "I'd prefer none of you eat these at all."
msgstr "Я надеюсь, никто не станет всё это есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "I'll take the ones you don't want, dears."
msgstr "Я возьму одну, которую ты не будешь, дорогуша."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "How darling!"
msgstr "Как мило!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "I had best not hear of any tummy aches later."
msgstr "Лучше воздержусь от ворчания живота после этих сладостей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "Bottled valor."
msgstr "Бутилированная доблесть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "An impressive elixir."
msgstr "Впечатляющий эликсир."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "Not as potent as I would have liked."
msgstr "Не такой сильнодействующий, как хотелось бы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "It appears combustible."
msgstr "Он кажется горючим."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "It seems to catalyze a mutation."
msgstr "Похоже, он катализирует мутацию."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "An ornamental poltergeist meant to be hung somewhere."
msgstr "Декоративный полтергейст. Значит, его надо куда-то повесить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "A flourish of flying mammal."
msgstr "Великолепное летающее млекопитающее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "An arborator adornment of the arachnid variety."
msgstr "Древесное украшение типа «арахнид»."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "I really should decorate."
msgstr "Мне и впрямь стоит что-нибудь украсить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "An ornament such as this should be hung up."
msgstr "Такое украшение должно висеть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "A corvus such as this would do better in a tree."
msgstr "Такие вороны лучше всего смотрятся на деревьях."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "This was perhaps not the most efficient use of resources."
msgstr "Возможно, это было не самое эффективное использование ресурсов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "A worker's tool."
msgstr "Рабочий инструмент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "That looks much too strenuous."
msgstr "Выглядит слишком напряженным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "The woolen fibers of a beefalo's coat make for excellent padding."
msgstr "Волокна шерсти бифало создают отличную подкладку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "What a fascinating use of kelp."
msgstr "Какое увлекательное использование ламинарии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "It gives off a delicate floral aroma."
msgstr "Он источает нежный цветочный аромат."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "This seems ill-suited for a restful night's sleep."
msgstr "Она плохо подходит для спокойного ночного сна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "A dare? What childish nonsense."
msgstr "Вызов? Что за детская чушь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "I prefer tweed."
msgstr "Я предпочитаю твид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "A natural disinfectant."
msgstr "Натуральный дезинфектор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "This salve is derived from gastropod secretions."
msgstr "Смесь, созданная из секреций брюхоногих."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "It is thankless work."
msgstr "Это неблагодарная работа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "It's a bit chilly."
msgstr "Слегка прохладный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Its temperature is below freezing."
msgstr "Его температура ниже точки замерзания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "Its temperature is totally unremarkable."
msgstr "Его температура совсем не ощущается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "It is warm enough to radiate heat and light!"
msgstr "Он достаточно нагрелся, чтобы излучать тепло и свет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "It is retaining thermal energy. But only a bit."
msgstr "Он аккумулировал тепловую энергию. Но только совсем чуть-чуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Ah. That would explain the respiration."
msgstr "А. Это объяснило бы дыхание."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "How odd. This rose bush appears to be... breathing."
msgstr "Как странно. Этот розовый куст, кажется... дышит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "My, she is a bit rude, isn't she?"
msgstr "Божечки, она немного груба, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
msgid "This beverage raises one's body temperature."
msgstr "Этот напиток повышает температуру тела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
msgid "It is a herbal remedy for madness prevention."
msgstr "Это растительное средство для профилактики безумия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "A stronger brew to cure a particularly severe bout of madness."
msgstr "Более крепкий напиток для лечения особо тяжёлого приступа безумия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "This brew renders lunar entities indifferent to us."
msgstr "Этот настой делает лунных существ безразличными к нам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS"
msgid "A rather calming concoction."
msgstr "Довольно успокаивающая смесь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Sometimes a little madness is appropriate."
msgstr "Иногда немного безумия не повредит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "The cooling refreshment is ideal for summer."
msgstr "Освежающий напиток, идеально подходящий для лета."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "It is a revitalizing brew."
msgstr "Это бодрящий напиток."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
msgid "The remnants of a lighting apparatus."
msgstr "Остатки осветительного прибора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "It illuminates the space nicely."
msgstr "Он хорошо освещает пространство."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
msgid "Pearl dear, where would you like this?"
msgstr "Жемчужинка, дорогая, где бы ты хотела, чтобы я его поставила?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "Oh dear, it's empty. I'll try again later."
msgstr "О боже, тут пусто. Попробую позже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL"
msgid "This instrument will transport the holder instantly to Pearl's."
msgstr "Этот инструмент мгновенно перемещает владельца к Жемчужинке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE"
msgid "There is nothing quite like a good cup of tea."
msgstr "Нет ничего лучше хорошей чашки чая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING"
msgid "I'm happy to support a small business."
msgstr "Я рада поддержать малый бизнес."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT"
msgid "How awful."
msgstr "Какой ужас."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "I do hope she's in soon."
msgstr "Надеюсь, она скоро подойдёт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "This will do nicely."
msgstr "Это будет очень кстати."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "The spring has dried up."
msgstr "Источник пересох."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "My old feet could use a good soak."
msgstr "Мои старые ноги могли бы хорошо попариться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR"
msgid "It is a hot spring for soaking underneath that tarp."
msgstr "Под брезентом находится горячий источник, в котором можно отдохнуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "Improving your living space can do wonders for one's mood."
msgstr "Улучшение вашего жилищного пространства может значительно улучшить настроение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Tsk. Look at the state of it..."
msgstr "Ох. Только посмотрите на его состояние..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY"
msgid "Laundry."
msgstr "Стирка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT"
msgid "An attractive ornament to be hung on Pearl's house."
msgstr "Привлекательное украшение для дома Жемчужинки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "How very welcome!"
msgstr "Как же любезно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "How very welcome!"
msgstr "Как же любезно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "I should tell her."
msgstr "Мне стоит рассказать ей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "Oh dear, I do hope I can find him."
msgstr "О боже, я так надеюсь, что смогу найти его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "It's exuding powerful pheromones."
msgstr "Он излучает мощные феромоны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "A place to kick up one's feet."
msgstr "Место, где можно и разуться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Not much of an aid now."
msgstr "Теперь не особенно помогает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "A navigational aid. \"You are here\"."
msgstr "На табличке написано: \"Вы здесь\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "A chance to give direction."
msgstr "Возможность оставить подсказку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Sweetened plant nectar."
msgstr "Сладчайший растительный нектар."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "Beeswax used for storing honey."
msgstr "Пчелиный воск используется для хранения мёда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Honey was the only sweetener used for this lovely ham."
msgstr "Мёд был самым сладким ингредиентом в этом блюде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "Bite-sized sweetened meat!"
msgstr "Мелко порубленное подслащённое мясо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "What an excellent specimen! I can almost hear the beefalo."
msgstr "Какой чудесный экземпляр! Я почти слышу зов бифало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "Highly concentrated ectoplasmic residue."
msgstr "Высококонцентрированный остаток эктоплазмы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE"
msgid "This trinket confers a favorable advantage, yet its effect cannot be quantified."
msgstr "Эта безделица сильно повышает удачу, но её эффект не поддается систематизации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Chili gives me indigestion."
msgstr "От чили у меня несварение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "Yes, I'll definitely soak my feet later."
msgstr "Да, я позже определенно пропарю ноги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "The spring will replenish itself in good time."
msgstr "Источник восполнится в своё время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "My old feet could use a good soak."
msgstr "Мои старые ноги могли бы хорошо попариться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "I strongly suspect moon glass is organic in composition now."
msgstr "Я подозреваю, что лунное стекло теперь органическое по составу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "That hound is not domesticated."
msgstr "Эта собака не одомашнена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "The endoskeleton of Canis lupus, definitely not familiaris."
msgstr "Эндоскелет Canis lupus, определённо не familiaris."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That ought to prevent any more mishaps."
msgstr "Это должно предотвратить ещё какие-нибудь неприятности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It would be in our best interest to dispose of it quickly."
msgstr "В наших же интересах побыстрее избавиться от этого."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Fascinating, it's reanimating before my eyes."
msgstr "Завораживающе, оживает прямо на моих глазах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "Those bones are foreboding."
msgstr "Эти кости - дурной знак."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "Made of calcium and brimstone."
msgstr "Состоит из кальция и серы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "An improvised dental projectile device."
msgstr "Импровизированное стоматологически-снарядное устройство."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "It emits a frequency undetectable to the human ear."
msgstr "Издает звуки на частоте, неслышной человеческому уху."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Eons of subterranean evolution went into this widdle malformed monstrosity."
msgstr "Это существо прошло через много лет подземной эволюции."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "Pygocentrus Nattereri."
msgstr "Pygocentrus Nattereri."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "Mortuus piscis."
msgstr "Mortuus piscis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "The solid state of water."
msgstr "Эта вода в твёрдом состоянии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "We ought to steer the ships clear of that."
msgstr "Мы должны держать корабли подальше от этого места."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "From dangerous solid to harmless liquid. Thank-you, heat."
msgstr "От опасного твёрдого вещества до безвредной жидкости. Спасибо тебе, жара."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "From dangerous solid to harmless liquid. Thank-you, heat."
msgstr "От опасного твёрдого вещества до безвредной жидкости. Спасибо тебе, жара."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "It is a crude heat exchanger."
msgstr "Почти такой же создал Джон Гори в 1850-ом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Nothing like a book and a bowl of ice cream."
msgstr "Ничто не сравнится с хорошей книжкой и мисочкой мороженного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "A perfect cube of ice."
msgstr "Идеальный куб льда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "What a strange, cold beast."
msgstr "Какой странный, холодный зверь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Perfectly insulated."
msgstr "Превосходно изолирован."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "Some kind of ice-throwing contraption."
msgstr "Какая-то разновидность бросающегося льдом приспособления."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2"
msgid "A magically-attuned chilling implement."
msgstr "Магически настроенное ледяное орудие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3"
msgid "It gives off a powerful chill."
msgstr "От него исходит мощный холод."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It's always prudent to have a set of winter garments."
msgstr "Всегда разумно иметь комплект зимней одежды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I must be seeing things."
msgstr "Я, наверное, с ума схожу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "It appears to be a tiny pyramid."
msgstr "Похоже на крошечную пирамиду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "It seems to utilize radio waves to pinpoint the location of anomalous objects."
msgstr "По-видимому, он использует радиоволны для точного определения местоположения аномальных объектов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "I'm aging like a fine, intelligent wine, am I not?"
msgstr "Я старею как хорошее, добротное вино, не правда ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP"
msgid "Ingesting it would be detrimental to one's health."
msgstr "Проглатывание этого было бы вредно для здоровья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE"
msgid "This plant is quite territorial."
msgstr "Довольно территориальное растение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "I'd love some toast to put this jam on. Oh well."
msgstr "Хотелось бы ещё и тост для того,\n чтобы было куда намазать этот джем. Ну да ладно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "Sweets, emulsified with beeswax."
msgstr "Конфеты, содержащие пчелиный мёд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE"
msgid "I may find something of use within."
msgstr "Может, я смогу найти что-то полезное внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT"
msgid "There is something at the top."
msgstr "Там что-то на вершине."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC"
msgid "The danger far outweighs the possibility of discovering anything of value."
msgstr "Риски перевешивают шансы обнаружить там что-то стоящее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
msgid "It would be nice to have some buttered toast to go with it."
msgstr "Было бы неплохо съесть ещё и немного тостов с маслом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Meat on a stick, what next?"
msgstr "Мясо на палке. Что дальше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "It is an edible kelp species."
msgstr "Съедобный вид водорослей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "It understandably has an effect on one's emotional wellbeing."
msgstr "Понятно, что он влияет на эмоциональное состояние человека."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "That certainly didn't improve the texture."
msgstr "Это определённо не улучшило её структуру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "It's slightly more palatable with this texture."
msgstr "В такой форме она более приемлема."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is especially venomous."
msgstr "Эта особенно ядовита."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "It is not pleased."
msgstr "Она явно не рада."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "Gone with the fire."
msgstr "Исчезло в огне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "Its movement appears to be hypnotic to the kittens."
msgstr "Его движения оказывают гипнотический эффект на котят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "Materials to construct entertaining toys for kittens."
msgstr "Материалы для создания развлекательных игрушек для котят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "Unfortunately, it's useless now."
msgstr "К сожалению, оно теперь бесполезно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "I used to have one of those back home."
msgstr "У меня дома была такая же."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "Materials to construct entertaining toys for kittens."
msgstr "Материалы для создания развлекательных игрушек для котят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "It seems the kittens have lost their residence."
msgstr "Похоже, котята лишились своего места жительства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A well-constructed habitation for the kittens."
msgstr "Хорошо собранное пристанище для котят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
msgid "The kittens are currently attempting to hide."
msgstr "Котята в данный момент пытаются спрятаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "The kittens' hiding game will come to an end soon."
msgstr "Игра котят в прятки скоро подойдёт к концу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT"
msgid "Materials to construct a proper kitten household."
msgstr "Материалы для создания правильной кошачьей обители."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "Oh dear, you are quite adorable."
msgstr "Ох божечки, ты просто очаровашка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT"
msgid "They possess large ears to facilitate hunting small desert critters."
msgstr "Они обладают большими ушами, облегчающими охоту на мелких пустынных существ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST"
msgid "It appears to have developed a form of camouflage."
msgstr "Похоже, он выработал определённую форму камуфляжа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS"
msgid "Oh dear, have you been startled?"
msgstr "Ох божечки, я не напугала тебя?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH"
msgid "This feline has quite an uncanny appearance."
msgstr "У этого котёнка довольно зловещий вид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "A feline? From the moon? Quite fascinating..."
msgstr "Котёнок? С луны? Довольно любопытно..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "Ah, it does bring back memories of my dear old cat..."
msgstr "Ах, действительно навевает воспоминания о моём старом дорогом коте..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "Hmm, their body language seems to imply annoyance."
msgstr "Хм-м, язык их тела, похоже, выражает раздражение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "The resemblance to a Panthera tigris is incredible."
msgstr "Схожесть с Panthera tigris невероятна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "Oh dear, the bell truly augments your... cuteness. Ho ho!"
msgstr "Ох божечки, колокольчик правда подчёркивает твою... Милоту. Хо-хо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "It uses its powerful olfactory sense to locate prey."
msgstr "Он использует своё острое обоняние, чтобы найти добычу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Hmm. Quite a sturdy antler."
msgstr "Хм. Довольно прочный рог."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "How curious."
msgstr "Как любопытно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "An automatic equine."
msgstr "Автоматическая лошадь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Its nightmare fueled surroundings have corrupted its programming."
msgstr "Кажется, это кошмарное окружение нарушило алгоритмы его поведения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING"
msgid "It follows me on account of the particular garb I wear."
msgstr "Он следует за мной из-за этого чудного наряда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
msgid "It is pledged to another."
msgstr "Он вверен кому-то другому."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "This is a decidedly unruly breed!"
msgstr "Это совершенно неуправляемая порода!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "This creature has expired."
msgstr "Это существо умерло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "Koalefanta Proboscidea."
msgstr "Koalefanta Proboscidea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "Koalefanta Proboscidea in thick winter pelage."
msgstr "Koalefanta Proboscidea с густым и тёплым мехом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "High in protein and fiber."
msgstr "С высоким содержанием белка и клетчатки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "It's a mythological holiday monster."
msgstr "Это мифологический рождественский монстр."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "It seems bigger inside than out."
msgstr "Кажется, он внутри больше, чем снаружи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "A refuelable light source."
msgstr "Перезаправляемый источник света."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "Delightfully crispy."
msgstr "Восхитительно хрустят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Best for someone on the receiving end of harsh attacks."
msgstr "Лучше дать её тому, кто получает жестокие атаки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "I'll leave that to one of the younger folks."
msgstr "Я оставлю это одному из младших."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "Light, but not particularly protective."
msgstr "Лёгкая, но защищает не слишком хорошо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "The lightweight material grants the wearer better mobility."
msgstr "Лёгкий материал даёт надевшему наилучшую мобильность."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "This ought to prevent grievous harm from befalling the wearer."
msgstr "Это должно предотвратить нанесение тяжкого вреда владельцу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "I can't say it would be much use to me."
msgstr "Я не могу сказать, что это будет очень полезно для меня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "A weave of magic replenishes the wearer's will."
msgstr "Переплетение волшебства пополняет энергию владельца."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "Safety first."
msgstr "Безопасность прежде всего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "That banner is invigorating nearby enemies."
msgstr "Этот баннер подбадривает окружающих врагов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "Fascinating. It is animated, even here."
msgstr "Очаровательный. Он анимирован, даже здесь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "He has a chip on his shoulder, though I couldn't say why."
msgstr "У него есть чип на плече, хотя я не могу сказать, почему."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "Goodness, I've no desire to wear such a thing."
msgstr "Боже, у меня нет желания носить такое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "It is bound to our service."
msgstr "Это связано с нашими услугами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "An enviable magic relic, I must say."
msgstr "Должен сказать, завидная магическая реликвия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "A weak enchantment is present on this wreath."
msgstr "В этом венке присутствует слабое очарование."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "I prefer my books."
msgstr "Я предпочитаю свои книги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "This will amplify the effects of incoming healing magic."
msgstr "Это усилит эффекты входящей целительной магии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "Proximity to the blossoms produces a restorative effect for the user."
msgstr "Близость к цветкам создаёт для пользователя восстановительный эффект."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "Goodness. I could never lift that!"
msgstr "Боже. Я бы никогда не подняла это!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "It requires a key."
msgstr "Для этого требуется ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "All ready for activation."
msgstr "Все готово для активации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "How brutish."
msgstr "Как жестоко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "Quite the unusual axe."
msgstr "Совсем необычный топор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It is linked to our Gateway, but inactive on this side."
msgstr "Он связан с нашими Вратами, но неактивен с этой стороны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Well, this was an unexpected foray."
msgstr "Ну, это был неожиданный набег."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "A focal point for magical energies."
msgstr "Координационный центр для магической энергии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "It seems to facilitate local teleportation."
msgstr "Кажется, это облегчает местную телепортацию."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I'll leave that to someone a tad more spry."
msgstr "Я оставлю это кому-то более подвижному."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "This strengthens the wearer's restorative magicks."
msgstr "Это усиливает восстановление магии носителя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "I believe it is a larval dragonfly."
msgstr "Полагаю, это личинка драконьей мухи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "A domestication opportunity, I'd say."
msgstr "Теперь она более подходит для жизни в обществе, я бы сказала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "A large macrolecithal egg."
msgstr "Большое макролецитальное яйцо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "The temperature of this egg is below optimal."
msgstr "Температура этого яйца ниже нормы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "This egg is at a suitable temperature for hatching."
msgstr "Это яйцо содержится в подходящих условиях для вылупления."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "I have to admit it is rather appealing."
msgstr "Вынуждена признать, выглядит она достаточно обаятельно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "A healthy larval dragonfly."
msgstr "Вполне здоровая личинка драконьей мухи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "This creature is hungry."
msgstr "Это существо проголодалось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "This creature requires sustenance immediately!"
msgstr "Этому созданию немедленно необходима пища!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "An egg tooth used by a baby reptile to break out of its egg."
msgstr "Яйцевой зуб, используемый новорождёнными рептилиями для того, чтобы пробить скорлупу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "It's cooled down, almost like basalt."
msgstr "Она остыла, почти как базальт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Its saliva is similar to molten lava."
msgstr "Её слюна подобна раскалённой лаве."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "Molten rock. Best not to get too close."
msgstr "Расплавленная порода. Лучше не подходить слишком близко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "Recently cooled igneous rock. Dangerous."
msgstr "Недавно охлаждённая вулканическая порода. Осторожно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "Such an unusual flavor!"
msgstr "Такой необычный аромат!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "At least I shouldn't have to worry about it being undercooked."
msgstr "По крайней мере, мне не придётся беспокоиться о том, что он недожарен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "It seems to be made from a plant-based gelatin of sorts."
msgstr "По-видимому, он сделан из растительного желатина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "I... don't even know."
msgstr "Я... даже не знаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "I believe it requires the application of a flame."
msgstr "Я считаю, что он требует применения пламени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "I... don't even know."
msgstr "Я... даже не знаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "A symbiote! A fungus and a phycobiontic bacteria."
msgstr "Симбиот! Грибок и фикобионическая бактерия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "The mold appears to have medicinal properties."
msgstr "Образец, по всей видимости, обладает медицинскими свойствами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "Is this animal or vegetable?"
msgstr "Это животное или растение?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "Their translucent shells allow the bioluminescence of their bodies to shine through."
msgstr "Их полупрозрачные оболочки позволяют просвечивать биолюминесценции их тел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Ah, a mechanical tool for fire starting. How useful."
msgstr "А, механический инструмент для разведения огня. Очень полезно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "If it could be convinced to stay still, it would make an excellent reading light."
msgstr "Если бы можно было заставить его не двигаться, из него бы вышел хороший светильник для чтения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Quite keen."
msgstr "Неслабо заряжена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "A variant of Capra aegagrus, keen on electricity."
msgstr "Разновидность Capra aegagrus, заряженная электричеством."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "There must be something unnatural in the horn."
msgstr "В этом роге должно быть что-то необычное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Radiant electrical energy!"
msgstr "Да он сияет от электричества!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "Highly conductive!"
msgstr "У него хорошая проводимость!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "The juvenile is not as aggressive."
msgstr "Молодые особи не так агрессивны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "This log is special."
msgstr "Это бревно особенное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "This tree is special."
msgstr "Это дерево особенное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "The root cutting of a beastly tree."
msgstr "Срез корня ужасного дерева."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "Ah. Its horror has taken root."
msgstr "Ох. Этот ужас пустил свои корни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "I'd almost forgotten what real food tasted like."
msgstr "Я почти забыла, какая настоящая еда на вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "How decadent."
msgstr "Как утончённо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "An axial section of tree trunk. On fire."
msgstr "Осевое сечение ствола дерева. Теперь в огне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "An axial section of tree trunk."
msgstr "Осевое сечение ствола дерева."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
msgid "I have no patience for garden pests!"
msgstr "У меня нет времени на садовых вредителей!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1"
msgid "How odd... perhaps it's merely a mirage."
msgstr "Как странно... возможно, это просто мираж."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10"
msgid "How odd... perhaps it's merely a mirage."
msgstr "Как странно... возможно, это просто мираж."

