msgstr "М-м-м-м... Ягодки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED"
