#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN"
