#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
