msgstr "А-а-а! Поджечь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD"
