msgstr "Лава, покрытая коркой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
