#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "How am I supposed to burn it now?"
msgstr "Как я должна это сжечь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "How am I supposed to burn it now?"
msgstr "Как я должна это сжечь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "It's a castle!"
msgstr "Это ладья!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It has a nasty smile."
msgstr "У неё ужасная улыбка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "What should we tie up??!"
msgstr "Что бы мне ею связать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT"
msgid "I'd rather burn a bridge than build one."
msgstr "Я лучше сожгу мост, чем построю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "They're a lot flowerier than Winona's usual style."
msgstr "Тут гораздо больше цветов, чем в обычном стиле Виноны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC"
msgid "Ew! Why? Oh Why?!"
msgstr "Фу! Почему? Ну почему?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "It's so sweet!"
msgstr "Оно такое сладкое!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "Broken furniture."
msgstr "Сломанная мебель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "It seems like there's something flowing through it."
msgstr "Если внимательно приглядеться, то можно заметить,\n что через неё как бы протекает что-то."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "This will keep the nasties at bay."
msgstr "Это поможет отогнать всякую гадость."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "That could probably be fixed up."
msgstr "Наверное, я смогу починить её."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A very very old chest."
msgstr "Очень старый сундук."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "I think it's judging me."
msgstr "Я думаю, что за это меня осудят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "I bet it stinks under the saddle."
msgstr "Могу поспорить, под седлом шерсть уже задохнулась."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "It's so uncomfortable."
msgstr "Как неудобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "Was it worth it? I think it was worth it."
msgstr "Оно того стоило? Думаю, что стоило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW"
msgid "I could shoot a fire dart or two from there."
msgstr "Оттуда я бы огненными дротиками постреляла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "I'm going to raze some villages!"
msgstr "Поеду, спалю дотла пару деревень!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "Think of how cool I'd look riding into battle on that!"
msgstr "Только представьте, как круто я буду выглядеть, сидя на этом во время битвы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "Hey, this is great!"
msgstr "Эй, это здорово!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "It'll keep my stuff from rotting, for a little while."
msgstr "Он убережёт мою еду от гниения на некоторое время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "It's a big block of slobbery salt."
msgstr "Большой куб слюнявой соли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED"
msgid "I'm so glad I'm not a beefalo."
msgstr "Я так рада, что я не бифало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK"
msgid "I wonder if it's flammable."
msgstr "Интересно, горит ли он вообще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
msgid "Huh. That's... weird."
msgstr "Хм. Это... странно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "Okay, hear me out... what if I tried burning it?"
msgstr "Окей, просто выслушай... что если бы я подожгла его?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "Someone got all the salt already."
msgstr "Кто-то уже забрал всю соль."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG"
msgid "Alright fine, you're kinda cute."
msgstr "Ладно, ладно, ты довольно милый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT"
msgid "Is that real fur?"
msgstr "Это настоящая шерсть?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Buuurn!"
msgstr "Гори-и-и!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Burn it!"
msgstr "Сожги это!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I wonder what these markings mean."
msgstr "Интересно, что эти надписи означают?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Where'd it go?"
msgstr "Куда оно делось?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "Burn! Yeah!"
msgstr "Гори! Да!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "Burn the sick!"
msgstr "Сжечь заразу!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "Blech. You smell."
msgstr "Фу. Воняет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It'd be worth it to pick that."
msgstr "Надо бы его взять."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "Poor little limp tree."
msgstr "Бедное маленькое чахлое деревце."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "It's so dry, it's like it WANTS to be on fire."
msgstr "Он так высох. Прямо напрашивается в огонь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "Looks like dumb science stuff for nerds."
msgstr "Похоже на тупую научную чушь для ботаников."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "It's a burning man."
msgstr "Человек-огонь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Just burnt straw."
msgstr "Просто выжженная солома."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Ha! He thinks he's people!"
msgstr "Ха! Он думает, он человек!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "Ewwwwwwwwwww!"
msgstr "Фуууууууууу!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE"
msgid "Another page for the emergency kindling supply- I mean scrapbook."
msgstr "Ещё одна страница для экстренной растопки- в смысле, заметок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT"
msgid "Heh. I like it!"
msgstr "Хех. Мне это нравится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT"
msgid "Am I gonna start saying stuff like \"quite\" and \"indubitably\"?"
msgstr "Я теперь начну говорить слова типа \"относительно\" и \"феноменально\"?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "I'm gonna carve a stone butt."
msgstr "Я собираюсь вырезать этот каменный зад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Haha!"
msgstr "Ха-ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Hm... I could make things that DON'T burn?"
msgstr "Хм... Я могу создать только то, что гореть НЕ будет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "I guess that's good, too."
msgstr "Думаю, вышло неплохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Not burnable. Not interested."
msgstr "Не горит. Не интересно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Humpty Dumpty's back together again."
msgstr "Вот и собрали Шалтая-Болтая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "Ew! It's wriggling!"
msgstr "Ой! Оно шевелится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "The crank doesn't even turn!"
msgstr "Даже не повернуть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "Gross. I don't think that was supposed to come off."
msgstr "Не думала, что она может отколоться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "It's a marble statue, I guess."
msgstr "Это мраморная статуя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "He didn't even say \"thank you\"."
msgstr "Он даже не сказал \"спасибо\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "Ew! It's wriggling!"
msgstr "Ой! Шевелится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "That thing looks terrible."
msgstr "Эта штука выглядит ужасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Great, now we've irritated some marble crime boss!"
msgstr "Здорово, теперь мы разозлили босса мраморной мафии!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Looks like a bunch of rubble to me."
msgstr "Для меня это просто куча щебня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "I'm more used to destroying things than fixing them."
msgstr "Я больше ломала, чем строила."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Ew! It's wriggling!"
msgstr "Ой! Шевелится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "What a creepy load of junk!"
msgstr "Какая жуткая гора хлама!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "Ha, falling to pieces. Rookie mistake."
msgstr "Распалась на кусочки. Сама виновата."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT"
msgid "Heh heh. Whoops."
msgstr "Хе-хе. Упс."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
msgid "Watery nerd stuff."
msgstr "Водянистые ботанические штуки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
msgid "Ew, what IS this?"
msgstr "Э, что ЭТО такое?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK"
msgid "It's just a big boring sea rock."
msgstr "Это просто большая скучная морская скала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE"
msgid "It's empty. So what?"
msgstr "Там пусто. И что дальше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL"
msgid "Great, it glows. But does it burn?"
msgstr "Отлично, оно светится. Но горит ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH"
msgid "It would be even easier to just set all the seeds on fire."
msgstr "Ещё проще было бы просто сжечь все семена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "Farming is boring."
msgstr "Земледелие - это не по мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "No good for farming now."
msgstr "Теперь уж больше не пойдут для высаживания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Pfft. It'll burn like the rest."
msgstr "Пфф. Он будет гореть так же, как и всё другое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "But destruction is so much more fun!"
msgstr "Но ведь уничтожать куда веселее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT"
msgid "I think it looks better, personally."
msgstr "Лично я думаю, что сейчас он выглядит лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Here, hold my stuff, would you?"
msgstr "Вот, подержи мои вещи, ладно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "At least something around here can hold it together."
msgstr "Хоть что-то может здесь удержать всё вместе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER"
msgid "Yep, that's pure nightmare fuel."
msgstr "Да, это чистое топливо для кошмаров."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "Eww, it's even creepier than the real one."
msgstr "Фуу, он хуже, чем реальный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "Oh, ewww! Who would ever touch that?!"
msgstr "О, фуу! Кто вообще до этого дотронется?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "Nope. Not going near that."
msgstr "Неа. Я туда не пойду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY"
msgid "There's no end to this thing!"
msgstr "Ей нет конца!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED"
msgid "Ha! Clumsy!"
msgstr "Ха! Вот неуклюжая!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD"
msgid "What are you staring at?"
msgstr "На что это ты уставилась?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS"
msgid "What has two hands and no feet? Whatever that thing is."
msgstr "У кого две руки и ноль ног? У этой штуковины."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS"
msgid "Go snack on somebody else!"
msgstr "Иди закуси кем-нибудь другим!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH"
msgid "Somehow I don't trust that smile."
msgstr "Почему-то этой улыбке я не доверяю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE"
msgid "Feed it to the flames!"
msgstr "Сжечь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS"
msgid "You don't scare me! Okay, maybe a little."
msgstr "Ты меня не пугаешь! Ну, может, немного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE"
msgid "Nasty. I like it."
msgstr "Грубый. Мне нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL"
msgid "I wonder if it will remember how it died."
msgstr "Интересно, вспомнит ли он, как помер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE"
msgid "Alright, let's get weird!"
msgstr "Окей, пора чудить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "I have to put it together myself?"
msgstr "И мне это самой собирать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN"
msgid "Disgusting! I don't care what it's got!"
msgstr "Гадость! Мне плевать, что оно там даёт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE"
msgid "Should have cremated them."
msgstr "Лучше бы его просто кремировали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHARK"
msgid "Uhh... nice fishy?"
msgstr "Э-э-э... хорошая рыбка?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI"
msgid "Fire beats ice any day of the week."
msgstr "Огонь всегда побеждает лëд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER"
msgid "What's with all the spikes? Someone could lose an eye."
msgstr "Зачем тут столько шипов? Так можно и глаз лишиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER"
msgid "Just a bunch of shells."
msgstr "Просто куча ракушек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR"
msgid "At least there's no eye gunk on it."
msgstr "По крайней мере в нём нет соринок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "Not great for fighting."
msgstr "Не очень подходит для драк."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Alright, time to find some stuff to dig up!"
msgstr "Если уж оценивать по лопатам, то она не такая плохая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT"
msgid "I dare someone to try it."
msgstr "Спорю, кому-нибудь слабо это съесть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE"
msgid "Cake's cake, pass it here."
msgstr "Пирог есть пирог, передавайте сюда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "Ew! Burn that!"
msgstr "Фе! Сжечь это!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "I always set them on fire."
msgstr "Я их постоянно поджигаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "They taught us how to make these in Girl Scouts."
msgstr "В лагере нас учили такие делать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "Mmmmmm. Smooth."
msgstr "М-м-м-м-м-м. Гладкая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC"
msgid "Ew, it's making noises!"
msgstr "Фу, она издаёт звуки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC"
msgid "Those things freak me out."
msgstr "Эти штуки меня пугают."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC"
msgid "Nope. No thanks."
msgstr "Неа. Нет, спасибо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC"
msgid "A pyre would've been more fun."
msgstr "Погребальный костёр был бы веселее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS"
msgid "I guess it's kind of pretty..."
msgstr "Ладно, я думаю, она довольно красивая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM"
msgid "So noisy."
msgstr "Как шумно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL"
msgid "They're driving me nuts."
msgstr "Они сводят меня с ума."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS"
msgid "You're doing it wrong, those flowers aren't dry enough to burn!"
msgstr "Ты всё делаешь не так, эти цветы недостаточно сухие, чтобы гореть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "I hope you at least went out in a blaze of glory."
msgstr "Я надеюсь, он отошёл в зените славы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "I've got a headache just looking at it."
msgstr "Голова болит от одного его вида."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER"
msgid "Nasty! Who left their smelly old skeleton here?"
msgstr "Мерзость! Кто оставил тут свой старый вонючий скелет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
