#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "You're looking a little pale there, red."
msgstr "Ты выглядишь немного бледным, красный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
