#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM"
msgid "What a nice pile of kindling!"
msgstr "Какая славная куча хвороста!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "You think you can judge me?!"
msgstr "Ты думаешь, что можешь судить меня?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
msgid "Ughhh, so much wooorrkk..."
msgstr "А-а-а, сколько работы-ы-ы..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "No regrets."
msgstr "Не о чём не жалею."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Let me guess, I've gotta give you something."
msgstr "Дай угадаю, мне нужно тебе что-то дать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "How come the rat-thing gets a shrine and I don't?"
msgstr "То есть какая-то крыса заслуживает алтарь, а я нет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "All's well that burns well."
msgstr "Все хорошо, что хорошо горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "This should be fun."
msgstr "Это должно быть весело."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "Getting dizzy yet?"
msgstr "Голова уже кружится?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "A gym-shaped pile of potential kindling."
msgstr "Куча потенциальной растопки в виде тренажерного зала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "All's well that burns well."
msgstr "Все хорошо, что хорошо горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure, why not."
msgstr "Конечно, почему бы и нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "Ha! I could watch this all day."
msgstr "Ха! Я могла бы смотреть за этим весь день."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "A gym-shaped pile of potential kindling."
msgstr "Куча потенциальной растопки в виде тренажерного зала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "All's well that burns well."
msgstr "Все хорошо, что хорошо горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "What if I just set it on fire a little bit? For motivation!"
msgstr "Что если я просто слегка подожгу его? Для мотивации!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "Look at those little legs go!"
msgstr "Только посмотри на эти мелкие ножки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "A gym-shaped pile of potential kindling."
msgstr "Куча потенциальной растопки в виде тренажерного зала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "All's well that burns well."
msgstr "Все хорошо, что хорошо горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "Not my idea of \"feeling the burn\"."
msgstr "Не моё представление о \"жжении в мышцах\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "Go on, get the berry!"
msgstr "Давай, бери ягоду!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "A gym-shaped pile of potential kindling."
msgstr "Куча потенциальной растопки в виде тренажерного зала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "Looks perfectly flammable to me."
msgstr "Выглядит совершенно воспламеняемым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "There's not nearly enough fire in those lanterns."
msgstr "В этих фонарях даже не близко достаточно огня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Now that's more like it."
msgstr "Это уже больше похоже на правду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "I should set it on fire, it'll be easier to see that way."
msgstr "Мне стоит поджечь его, так его легче видно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "Pfft, as if there was any doubt I'd win."
msgstr "Пфф, как будто кто-то сомневался в моей победе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "{winner} was just lucky, I'm winning the next one."
msgstr "{winner} просто повезло, я выиграю следующую."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "Let's see, where's a good spot for me to win?"
msgstr "Посмотрим, где мне лучше всего победить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "Mine's gonna win, obviously."
msgstr "Моя победит, очевидно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "What a gong show."
msgstr "Что за цирк."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Ha! Nice."
msgstr "Ха! Класс."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "Meh. I've seen better."
msgstr "Пфф. Я видела и получше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "Now we're talking!"
msgstr "А теперь поговорим!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "My Carrat's off the scale! I mean literally."
msgstr "Сила моей Морквокрысы неизмерима! Ну, пока что."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "A nice, scale-shaped pile of potential kindling."
msgstr "Куча потенциальной растопки в виде весов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "Просто куча семян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "Oh wow, special seeds, how exciting."
msgstr "Ничего себе, особые семена, так интересно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "It better be the only thing going into the water today."
msgstr "Лучше бы это была единственная вещь, которая сегодня войдёт в воду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Ooo, let's build an anchor."
msgstr "О-о-о, давайте построим якорь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "Отлично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's hungry for charcoal."
msgstr "Он жаждет угля."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "All hail the fire breather!"
msgstr "Да здравствует огнедышащая!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "It feels wrong to put it in the water... burning it after should even things out."
msgstr "Мне кажется неправильным класть его в воду... сжигать после того, как всё выровняется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "I'm great at steering! I don't even crash that often!"
msgstr "Я отлично управляю рулем! Я даже не так часто разбиваюсь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "Can't sail without that."
msgstr "Без этого не поплывешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "Some kids got all the good stuff."
msgstr "Всё лучшее каким-то детям..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "Tough looking horse."
msgstr "Крепкая конская головешка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Don't look at me."
msgstr "Не смотри на меня так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What do you want, horsehead?"
msgstr "Чего надо, мерин?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Alright, now give!"
msgstr "Ну всё, твоя очередь давать!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "Do I have to gallop?"
msgstr "Мне что, самой скакать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "Those fancy knights must've had fun with this thing."
msgstr "Эти чудным коням явно нравилось носиться с этими штуками."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "I'm gonna eat it all!"
msgstr "Я всё это съем!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Nah. I'll feed it to something."
msgstr "Неа. Я угощу этим кого-нибудь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "A little snack to fill my belly."
msgstr "Закуска, чтобы набить желудок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "Everything looks better in the firelight."
msgstr "В свете камина всё выглядит лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "Looks like it needs some more fire!"
msgstr "Похоже, ему нужно ещё немного огня!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "The more firelight around here, the better!"
msgstr "Чем больше здесь света от костра, тем лучше!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "Everything looks better in the firelight."
msgstr "В свете камина всё выглядит лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "Looks like it needs some more fire!"
msgstr "Похоже, ему нужно ещё немного огня!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "The more firelight around here, the better!"
msgstr "Чем больше здесь света от костра, тем лучше!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Alright, who wants to get the stuffing knocked out of them?"
msgstr "Ладно, кто хочет быть выбитым?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "Yeah! Get 'em!!"
msgstr "Да! Получай!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "Oh, this'll be fun..."
msgstr "О, это будет весело..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "Nice, the rabbits brought cake!"
msgstr "Здорово, кролики принесли торт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "It sure tastes... blue?"
msgstr "На вкус определённо... синий?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "Eww, it looks like a big jelly eyeball."
msgstr "Фу, это похоже на глаз из желе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "I'll just pop those in my mouth, quick as a bunny."
msgstr "Я просто отправлю их в рот, быстро, как кролик."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Now I'm smiling!"
msgstr "Теперь я улыбаюсь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I get the feeling it's hungry for something."
msgstr "У меня такое чувство, что он чего-то жаждет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What's it so smiley about?"
msgstr "Почему он улыбается?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "I'm gonna go slap the biggest rabbit I can find!"
msgstr "Я собираюсь прихлопнуть самого большого кролика, которого смогу найти!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "At least it burned bright!"
msgstr "По крайней мере горел он ярко!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "It'll be brighter if I burn it."
msgstr "Он будет гореть ещё ярче, если я его подожгу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "I can burn it as is."
msgstr "Я могу его сжечь и так, не устанавливая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "See? It worked!"
msgstr "Видите? Сработало!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
