msgstr "Эта шляпа поможет ощутить себя дождиком."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "That's fer a bit of self maintenance."
msgstr "Время для самообслуживания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "That'll do the trick."
msgstr "Умно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "Can't go home without the key."
msgstr "Домой не попасть без ключа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "Perfect assembly!"
msgstr "Отличная сборка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "Gives ya a lil extra punch!"
msgstr "Дает дополнительный удар!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "I could take a swing at it. Ha!"
msgstr "Я могла бы размахивать им. Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Just like the one I came through..."
msgstr "Такой же, как тот, с которого я пришла ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Welp, time to go!"
msgstr "Что ж, пора идти!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "I'd be so efficient with that!"
msgstr "С этим я буду намного эффективнее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "Wonder how it works?"
msgstr "Интересно как это работает?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I'm gonna be a real slugger with that thing!"
msgstr "С этим я буду настоящим бойцом!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "That'd be fer healin' my pals."
msgstr "Это должно подлечить моих товарищей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "I'm gonna squish that!"
msgstr "Я собираюсь раздавить это!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "We could probably wake it back up."
msgstr "Возможно мы могли бы разбудить его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe we shouldn't hatch this."
msgstr "Наверно нам не следует их высиживать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Looks chilly."
msgstr "Выглядит холодным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "It's feeling right as rain."
msgstr "Ощущаешь себя дождиком."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "You're a happy little fellow."
msgstr "Ты счастливый малыш."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "Seems friendly enough."
msgstr "Выглядит достаточно дружелюбно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "Let's fatten you up."
msgstr "Мы тебя откормим."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
