msgstr "Мне немного неловко. Хе-хе..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER"
