msgstr "Электричество отключилось, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "I can feel the dampness creepin' back in."
msgstr "Я чувствую, как у меня капли по спине ползут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "Anyone got a spare hockey helmet?"
msgstr "У кого-нибудь есть запасной хоккейный шлем?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "I'm gettin' tired, I think it's wearing off."
msgstr "Я начинаю уставать, мне кажется, эффект проходит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "That's enough hustlin' around for now."
msgstr "На сегодня рабочей суеты достаточно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
