msgstr "Юго-восток."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW"
msgid "Southwest."
msgstr "Юго-запад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W"
msgid "West."
msgstr "Запад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOST"
msgid "Can't say much for the food, but I like the presentation!"
msgstr "На счёт еды не знаю, мне нравится вид!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED"
msgid "Looks aboot right."
msgstr "Выглядит как и должно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT"
msgid "Well that's a smell."
msgstr "Вот это запашок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY"
msgid "Nah, that's too dry."
msgstr "Неа, суховато."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Not exactly a barrel of maple syrup..."
msgstr "Это, конечно, не бочка кленового сиропа..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET"
msgid "A bit too soggy."
msgstr "Слегка мокровато."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP"
msgid "Well. Plants gotta fertilize."
msgstr "Что ж. Растения нужно удобрять."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS"
msgid "Well, better get building."
msgstr "Ну, лучше начать строительство."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK"
msgid "Pretty handy. Luce, how aboot you read off the ingredients while I cook?"
msgstr "Довольно удобная. Люсь, как насчёт того, чтобы ты прочитала ингредиенты, пока я готовлю?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE"
msgid "Was that a bad thing to do?"
msgstr "Что, лучше было этого не делать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT"
msgid "Just like my dear old ma used to make."
msgstr "Как будто матушка моя состряпала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT"
msgid "I still don't want to eat it."
msgstr "И всё равно я не хочу это есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT"
msgid "That'll just make me hungrier!"
msgstr "От него только голод разыграется!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER"
msgid "That thing's hankering for a bite of my boat!"
msgstr "Эта тварь жаждет покромсать мою лодку!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT"
msgid "Hope this shell protects me better than it protected the last guy."
msgstr "Надеюсь, этот панцирь защитит меня лучше, чем она защищала последнего владельца."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL"
msgid "He was a tough nut to crack."
msgstr "Он был крепким орешком, которого трудно расколоть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like somethin' was written here, but it faded away."
msgstr "Похоже, здесь что-то было написано, но оно исчезло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "Burned to a crisp."
msgstr "Поджарен до хрустящей корочки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "It'll be a bit longer, eh?"
msgstr "Ещё подождать надо, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "Oh boy! Here it comes!"
msgstr "Опаньки! Щас будет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Time for supper!"
msgstr "Пора поесть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "It seems a waste to just leave it sitting there, empty."
msgstr "Жалко держать его пустым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COOLANT"
msgid "What is that stuff?"
msgstr "Что это такое?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
msgid "That's the end of that cat's tale."
msgstr "Это конец кошачьей истории."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN"
msgid "I like it, but not in everything that I eat."
msgstr "Вкусно, но не ко всему подходит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
msgid "Cooked with the goodness of corn."
msgstr "Приготовлено из божественной кукурузы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Shucks, that's a lot of corn!"
msgstr "Матушки, как много кукурузы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
msgid "I'm more of a hewer of wood than a tiller of soil."
msgstr "Я больше по части рубки деревьев, чем возделывания почвы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY"
msgid "Some kinda fancy theater costume."
msgstr "Какой-то вычурный театральный костюм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY"
msgid "Some kinda fancy theater costume."
msgstr "Какой-то вычурный театральный костюм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY"
msgid "Some kinda fancy theater costume."
msgstr "Какой-то вычурный театральный костюм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY"
msgid "Some kinda fancy theater costume."
msgstr "Какой-то вычурный театральный костюм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY"
msgid "Some kinda fancy theater costume."
msgstr "Какой-то вычурный театральный костюм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY"
msgid "Cute outfit."
msgstr "Миленький наряд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY"
msgid "Some kinda fancy theater costume."
msgstr "Какой-то вычурный театральный костюм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY"
msgid "It's not as scratchy as it looks."
msgstr "Не такой колючий, как кажется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC"
msgid "It could use some wood to burn."
msgstr "Ему не помешало бы добавить немного дров."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT"
msgid "It's kinda cute, eh?"
msgstr "Довольно мило, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC"
msgid "It could use some wood to burn."
msgstr "Ему не помешало бы добавить немного дров."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT"
msgid "That statue cleaned up nice."
msgstr "Эту статую хорошо почистили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC"
msgid "It could use some wood to burn."
msgstr "Ему не помешало бы добавить немного дров."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT"
msgid "Gleamin' like a sunrise over a glacier."
msgstr "Сияющий, как восход солнца над ледником."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET"
msgid "They don't make headwear like that in Canada."
msgstr "В Канаде таких головных уборов не делают."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "Looks like they're enjoyin' themselves."
msgstr "Похоже, им весело."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC"
msgid "I think we might've bothered him."
msgstr "Кажись, мы его разозлили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
msgid "Think that castle might be missing a gem or two, eh?"
msgstr "Кажись, этому замку не хватает драгоценного камня или два, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "These guys don't fight fair."
msgstr "Эти ребята дерутся нечестно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW"
msgid "Not the best time to make snap decisions, eh?"
msgstr "Не лучшее время для принятия поспешных решений, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
msgid "Reminds me of winters up North."
msgstr "Напоминает мне о северных холодах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB"
msgid "I guess it's crab season."
msgstr "Наверное, сейчас сезон крабов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT"
msgid "Not very friendly, eh?"
msgstr "А ты не очень-то дружелюбный, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "Anyone home?"
msgstr "Кто-нибудь дома?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN"
msgid "Sure got a spring in your step, eh?"
msgstr "Идёшь по жизни вприпрыжку, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "Don't start no forest fires now, buddy."
msgstr "Не начинай лесные пожары, приятель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "We'll have to get you some protective eye gear there, bud."
msgstr "Нам придётся подобрать тебе какую-нибудь защиту для глаза, дружок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "Charmingly chubby."
msgstr "Очаровательно пухлый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "Giving it pats is relaxing."
msgstr "Гладишь его и расслабляешься."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "Heh, it feels like a beard."
msgstr "Хех, на ощупь как борода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING"
msgid "That's my little forest buddy."
msgstr "Мой маленький лесной приятель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "Look, it's not you. It's me."
msgstr "Смотри, эт не ты. Это я."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Man and robot's best friend."
msgstr "Лучший друг человека и робота."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "He's planning something. I can tell."
msgstr "Он что-то замышляет. Говорю тебе!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "You'll pay for your crimes, crow!"
msgstr "Ты заплатишь за свои преступления, ворон!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "I think we're supposed to follow these."
msgstr "Думаю, мы должны идти по ним."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "I know a curse when I see it."
msgstr "Уж я-то проклятие смогу распознать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "I think I might be allergic to this."
msgstr "У меня на это может быть аллергия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "Sorry, I might've taken a little bite."
msgstr "Извини, я немножко откусил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "Yum! Tastes woody!"
msgstr "Ням-ням! На вкус почти как древесинка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Want to hear my loon call?"
msgstr "Сделать из них дудочку?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Part of the Canadian shield."
msgstr "Часть Канадского щита."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Not even so much as a \"thank you\", eh?"
msgstr "Не так уж и сложно сказать \"спасибо\", а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "Whatever he's got better not be contagious."
msgstr "Без разницы что у него, главное, что не заразно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "Should we help him out, Luce?"
msgstr "Может, нам стоит ему помочь, Люсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey there, buddy. You don't look so bad."
msgstr "Привет, приятель. Выглядишь ты не так уж плохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "No good deed goes unpunished."
msgstr "Не делай добра - не получишь зла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "That's some firmly planted stone."
msgstr "Это какой-то намертво посаженный камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks sturdy... ish."
msgstr "Выглядит прочной... да."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "That doesn't smell quite right, eh."
msgstr "Как-то неправильно пахнет, а."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "Smells ripe."
msgstr "Запах свежий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "Nooo! I could have chopped it!"
msgstr "Не-е-ет! Я же мог срубить её!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste."
msgstr "Какое бессмысленное расточительство."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Ahhhh!"
msgstr "А-а-а-а-а!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's calling to me!"
msgstr "Она зовёт меня!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "You're due for a chopping."
msgstr "А тебя нужно срубить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "No Lucy, you may not cut the deck. I know what you mean."
msgstr "Нет, Люси, это не деревянная колода, а карточная. Её рубить нельзя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "I'm pretty sure it's makin' a statement. Aboot something."
msgstr "Это определённо какой-то комментарий. На что-то."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "It could use a bit of nature."
msgstr "Сюда б чутка природы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "Aboot time we brightened this place up, eh?"
msgstr "Давно была пора тут всё разукрасить, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "A little bit of nature makes everything nicer."
msgstr "Чутка природы всё делает шикарнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "We need bulbs, eh."
msgstr "Пора лампочки менять, а."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "Well, that's that."
msgstr "Что ж, всё."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "I'd rather have natural light, but it'll do."
msgstr "Я б, конечно, предпочёл естественный свет, да и ладно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks pretty realistic, eh?"
msgstr "Как реалистично, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "It ain't much to look at with no picture in it."
msgstr "На пустую картинку много не заглядишься."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "It's their spitting image!"
msgstr "Как вылитые!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Something's different aboot you..."
msgstr "Что-то с тобой не так..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a creature of the woods, eh?"
msgstr "Лесное созданье, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "That's a big moose!"
msgstr "Здоровый лось!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Smoke'em if you got'em."
msgstr "Если можешь - жги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "What's that Luce? Yup, she'll look great on the wall."
msgstr "Чего говоришь, Люсь? Ага, думаю тоже на стене будет смотреться прекрасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "What in the name of sweet Celine?"
msgstr "Во имя всего святого, что это такое?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "She'll keep the brews frosty all summer, eh?"
msgstr "Будет держать напитки холодными всё лето, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "The eye's been lifted? Where are we? Toronto?"
msgstr "Глаз взяли? Где мы находимся? Торонто?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "Better get buildin', eh?"
msgstr "Пора бы начать строить, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "Now what is this good for?"
msgstr "Ну а это для чего?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "Wish I still had a cabin I could mount these things in."
msgstr "Эх, если б у меня всё ещё было местечко для хранения таких вещей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "That ain't natural."
msgstr "Ненатурально."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's probably a tuft of grass."
msgstr "Наверное, это пучок травы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "That's easy on the eyes."
msgstr "Глазам легче."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT"
msgid "Remember how much it rained back home, Luce?"
msgstr "А помнишь, как часто дома шли дожди, Люсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED"
msgid "Take that, rain!"
msgstr "Так-то, дождик!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL"
msgid "I'm not commenting on that."
msgstr "Без комментариев."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "Hey! A clue!"
msgstr "Эй! След!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "It's really fuzzy from here."
msgstr "Оно где-то... неясно где."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder if it gets the hockey game."
msgstr "Интересно было бы сыграть этой штукой в хоккей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "Loud and clear! Something's near!"
msgstr "Громко и чётко! Оно рядом!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "I think I'm getting closer."
msgstr "Мне кажется, я приближаюсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Woah, careful there, bud."
msgstr "Вот-вот-вот, повнимательней, приятель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks like something should plug in."
msgstr "Кажется что-то должно включиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "It's ready to be unlocked."
msgstr "Эту штуку уже можно открывать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "Now all it needs is to be turned on."
msgstr "Теперь всё что нужно - это включить её."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "That's a weird looking rod."
msgstr "Какая-то подставка со странным стержнем."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT"
msgid "I can see it now, the whole ocean covered in beautiful timber..."
msgstr "Прямо вижу это перед своими глазами, целый океан покрыт прекрасными дровами..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM"
msgid "Looking at 'em is making me hungry."
msgstr "Смотря на них, у меня пробуждается аппетит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "I can doll it up all I want, it'll still be a beefalo."
msgstr "Я могу украшать его сколько угодно, он все равно останется бифало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT"
msgid "Fancy a sail, Lucy?"
msgstr "Красивый парус, Люси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK"
msgid "Everything's all packed and ready to go, eh?"
msgstr "Все упаковано и готово к отплыву, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "Nice needlework."
msgstr "Красиво сшито."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD"
msgid "Looks real good, buddy."
msgstr "Отлично выглядит, дружище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "She'll burn all the trees before I can chop them!"
msgstr "Она сожжёт все деревья до того, как я смогу срубить их!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Gaudy if you ask me."
msgstr "Экстравагантный, если тебя интересует моё мнение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "It's a bit much, eh? But at least it stores a lot."
msgstr "Перебор, а? Но, по крайней мере, в нём много чего хранится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "Tacky taxidermy."
msgstr "Липкое чучело."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "It got even tackier, eh?"
msgstr "Она стала ещё более липкой, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "I'm sweaty enough without help from a furnace."
msgstr "Я и без помощи печи вспотел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "Just bask in that warm glow."
msgstr "Просто грейся в тёплых лучах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "I've never seen one of those before."
msgstr "Такого я ещё не видал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "It tastes like maple syrup."
msgstr "На вкус прямо как кленовый сироп."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Guess I'm better at gardening than I thought, eh?"
msgstr "Наверное, я лучше разбираюсь в садоводстве, чем думал, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "Maybe I can grow them."
msgstr "Может, я смогу вырастить их."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "That's a sight, eh?"
msgstr "Голова, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "Almost as good as butter tarts!"
msgstr "Не сильно хуже канадских пирожков!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "Well, somebody's gotta do it."
msgstr "Ну, кто-то возьмет это."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "I still don't believe in dragons."
msgstr "Я всё ещё не верю в драконов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE"
msgid "There's something off aboot it."
msgstr "В нём что-то не так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT"
msgid "Gotta protect the old noggin', eh?"
msgstr "Надо защищать старую башку, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK"
msgid "I don't like where this is going, and I really don't like where it's comin' from."
msgstr "Не нравится мне куда это всё идёт, и мне не очень нравится откуда всё это идёт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG"
msgid "You poor log."
msgstr "Бедное брёвнышко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Hasn't it been through enough."
msgstr "Разве оно недостаточно пережило?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "It's over now."
msgstr "Теперь все кончено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Put it out of its misery."
msgstr "Я положил конец его страданиям"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "The sea sucked all the good tree juice out of it."
msgstr "Море высосало из него все древесные соки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "October food."
msgstr "Октябрьская еда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "Thanks, turkey."
msgstr "Спасибо, индейка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH"
msgid "It's missing the tree part!"
msgstr "Не хватает той части, которая дерево!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "Time for a little landscaping."
msgstr "Самое время благоустроить территорию."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "This would be more useful somewhere else, eh?"
msgstr "Это было бы полезнее где-нибудь ещё, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "It makes my eyes water."
msgstr "У меня от неё глаза слезятся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "I should plant this."
msgstr "Я должен его посадить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "They're kinda like cattails except... not."
msgstr "Они вроде как рогозы но... хвостозы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "Mmmmm. It's all twiggy."
msgstr "М-м-м-м. Веточки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH"
msgid "I should find a place to put it."
msgstr "Стоит найти место, куда её посадить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL"
msgid "Looks pretty heavy, eh?"
msgstr "Выглядит довольно тяжёлой, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM"
msgid "You just throw it at whoever ya don't like, eh? Sounds pretty cold."
msgstr "Её можно просто бросить в того, кто тебе не по нраву, а? Какое холодное отношение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM"
msgid "Choppin' trees is enough of a workout for me."
msgstr "Мне хватает рубки деревьев в качестве тренировки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN"
msgid "I'll stick to lifting my axe."
msgstr "Я уж лучше свой топор подниму."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT"
msgid "I think he took \"warm up\" too literally, eh?"
msgstr "Видимо, он воспринимает \"разогрев\" слишком буквально, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE"
msgid "I'll stick to lifting my axe."
msgstr "Я уж лучше свой топор подниму."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM"
msgid "Yer muscles won't be the only things on fire."
msgstr "В этот раз гореть будут не только мышцы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "It smells bad."
msgstr "Он воняет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "It smells even worse."
msgstr "Так он ещё хуже воняет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "No thank you very much."
msgstr "Нет, спасибо большое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "Maybe I could plant them?"
msgstr "Может, мне их посадить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE"
msgid "Tastes terrible. And that's speakin' as someone who's eaten raw lumber."
msgstr "Ужасно на вкус. И эт говорю я, который ел брёвна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH"
msgid "Let's compare moustaches later."
msgstr "Усами померяемся попозже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN"
msgid "Resourceful little guys!"
msgstr "Какие полезные ребятишки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "Where I'm from these'd only work in the fall."
msgstr "Там, откуда я родом, это пригодилось бы лишь осенью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "This should cook up nicely."
msgstr "Славный из него харч получится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "This cooked up nicely."
msgstr "Приготовлено на славу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "I bet the birds have something to do with this."
msgstr "Могу поспорить, обилие семян в нём привлекает птиц."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "Suspiciously birdy."
msgstr "Хм... Баклажан... Баклан-жан... Есть в этом что-то птичье."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It better not hatch into a giant purple bird."
msgstr "Надеюсь из него не вылупится огромная фиолетовая птица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "Maybe I could plant them?"
msgstr "Может, мне их посадить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER"
msgid "Think there's a spooky six-pack in there."
msgstr "Корзина для скляночек Абигейл."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT"
msgid "Just keep it away from the trees, eh?"
msgstr "Просто держи его подальше от деревьев, лады?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "A burnt wood table."
msgstr "Сгоревший деревянный стол."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Such a beaut of a wood table shouldn't be hidden by a cloth."
msgstr "Столь шикарная порода дерева не должна прятаться под тряпкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "Aboot time we brightened this place up, eh?"
msgstr "Мы осветим это место на какое-то время, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "A little bit of nature makes everything nicer."
msgstr "Природные материалы всегда ценятся больше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "We need bulbs, eh."
msgstr "Нам нужны лампочки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "Well, that's that."
msgstr "Ну, вот и всё."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "Nooo! I could have chopped it!"
msgstr "Не-е-ет! Я же мог срубить её!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste."
msgstr "Какое бессмысленное расточительство."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "Ahhhh!"
msgstr "А-а-а-а-а!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's calling to me!"
msgstr "Она зовёт меня!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Извините!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "How terrible!"
msgstr "Как ужасно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Another one!"
msgstr "И ещё одно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Lucy would want me to chop it down."
msgstr "Люси хочет, чтоб я его срубил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "Always good to have something watching over you."
msgstr "Всегда хорошо иметь кого-то, кто присматривает за тобой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "Protective eye gear that protects everything but the eyes."
msgstr "Защитный глаз, который защищает всё, кроме самих глаз."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Feast your eye on my axe!"
msgstr "Полюбуйся своим глазом на мой топор!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "It's rude to stare, eh?"
msgstr "Пялиться некрасиво, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "Probably shouldn't let that eye open."
msgstr "Наверное, не стоило оставлять тот глаз открытым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "It needs to mind its own business."
msgstr "Он занят своим делом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "That'll drive the hosers off."
msgstr "Теперь ни один обалдуй не сунется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "This needs to be installed properly."
msgstr "Его ещё нужно поставить правильно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "If it was a tree farm, I'd be sad."
msgstr "Если бы это была грядка для дерева, я бы расстроился."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "I prefer larger plants."
msgstr "Мне по душе растения побольше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "They'll never reach chopping size."
msgstr "Жди, не жди, а до дерева им никогда не дорасти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "I think it needs some poop."
msgstr "Надо бы подкинуть удобрений."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "Better get planting."
msgstr "Надо бы начать работать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "Who's the hoser that set my garden on fire?"
msgstr "Какой это садовод поджог мой огород?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "It's ready for picking."
msgstr "Готов к сбору."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What a beaut!"
msgstr "Вот красота!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "Whoops, looks like I've been tendin' to a weed this whole time."
msgstr "Упс, похоже всё это время я ухаживал за сорняком."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "A plant, eh?"
msgstr "Растение, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "Hey, I think it's grown a bit!"
msgstr "Эй, оно вроде слегка выросло!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "That's not looking so good..."
msgstr "Выглядит не особо..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "The only thing it's good for is compost."
msgstr "Только для компоста оно и годится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "Gotta be patient."
msgstr "Главное - это терпение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "Looks like it's got things under control."
msgstr "Похоже, у него всё под контролем."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "Where should we put the garden, Luce?"
msgstr "Где же нам устроить здесь огород, Люсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "I'd better clear that out of the way."
msgstr "Стоит убрать его с моего пути."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "A traditional Canadian fan."
msgstr "Традиционный Канадский веер."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "I want nothing to do with that... thing."
msgstr "Я не хочу носить эту... штуку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "The bird murder wasn't even necessary. Heh."
msgstr "Не было необходимости убивать птицу. Хех."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "A grody feather."
msgstr "Мерзкое перо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "A gross feather."
msgstr "Грязное перо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "A disgusting feather."
msgstr "Отвратительное перо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "A stupid feather."
msgstr "Дурацкое перо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "She's trapped!"
msgstr "Она в ловушке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "That's a good lookin' fence."
msgstr "Этот забор неплохо выглядит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just a post now."
msgstr "Обычный колышек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED"
msgid "That'll straighten your hair!"
msgstr "Аж борода распушилась!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM"
msgid "I suppose I could plant it."
msgstr "Наверное, стоит его поставить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "Some nice woodwork there."
msgstr "Какая хорошая работа по дереву."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "A good project for a lazy afternoon."
msgstr "Хорошая защита."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "A good project for a lazy afternoon."
msgstr "Хорошая защита."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "It's got nothin' on a sturdy wooden fence."
msgstr "У него нет ничего общего с прочным деревянным забором."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "Sometimes you've gotta show a fence who's boss, eh?"
msgstr "Иногда нужно показать забору, кто здесь главный, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "Poop belongs in a bucket, not on the ground."
msgstr "Навозу самое место в ведре, а не на земле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "Season's fishings!"
msgstr "Сезон рыбы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Looks pretty cheerful!"
msgstr "Здорово выглядит!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "That's one fancy fruit."
msgstr "Какой причудливый фрукт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "Now that's some real comfort food."
msgstr "Вот это я понимаю — комфортная еда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "Nothin' better than food served on a wooden stick, eh?"
msgstr "Нет ничего лучше, чем еда на палке, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "This stuff's not half bad, eh?"
msgstr "А эта штука вовсе не плохая, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "I'll leave it to someone more magic-inclined."
msgstr "Пусть этим всякие маги занимаются."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "Let's not set them off in the forest."
msgstr "Давайте просто не будем делать этого в лесу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "Reminds me of Algonquin park."
msgstr "Прямо как в Алгонкинском парке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "I've got a pocket full of sunshine!"
msgstr "У меня сияющие карманы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "Hot hound!"
msgstr "Тёпленькая собачка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "Note to self, \"do not touch.\""
msgstr "Маленькая заметка, \"Не трогать.\""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Пахнет неплохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "Keep it away from the trees!"
msgstr "Держите её подальше от деревьев!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "I should go chop some wood for that, eh?"
msgstr "Нужно пойти, нарубить немного дров, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "It uses wood."
msgstr "Ему нужно дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "Too much wood, too fast!"
msgstr "Слишком много дерева! Не торопись!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "There should be some wood around here somewhere."
msgstr "Где-то рядом должно быть ещё одно дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Mmmm. Smells woody."
msgstr "М-м-м-м. Пахнет древесиной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "If only I had some wood."
msgstr "Эх, были бы у меня дровишки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "I don't trust any sort of magic business."
msgstr "Не доверяю я этим магическим штукам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "It craves wood."
msgstr "Жаждет дерева."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "Lazy thing."
msgstr "Ленивая штука."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "Save the trees!"
msgstr "Спасай деревья!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Looks like a cod."
msgstr "Похожа на треску."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "I cast a wide net."
msgstr "Я заброшу широкую сеть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "I should spend some time at the lake."
msgstr "Надо бы как-нибудь съездить на озеро."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "I'd prefer salmon."
msgstr "Лучше бы был лосось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "I wish I had some chips."
msgstr "Жаль, что у меня нет чипсов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Beats bird jerky."
msgstr "Уж получше вяленой птицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "I hope I don't attract bears."
msgstr "Надеюсь, я не привлеку медведей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "Looks good to me."
msgstr "Ну, мне же лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED"
msgid "Beats bird jerky."
msgstr "Уж получше вяленой птицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "Elegant dining in a box."
msgstr "Изысканное лакомство в коробочке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Tastes like the sea, eh?"
msgstr "На вкус отдаёт чем-то морским, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "Reminds me of the old salmon fisheries."
msgstr "Напоминает мне о старой ловле лососей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Could use some chips."
msgstr "Сейчас бы ещё картохи нажарить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "This could be an axe head."
msgstr "Насадить на палку - и будет топор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED"
msgid "Had to come down sometime."
msgstr "Рано или поздно он бы опустился."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC"
msgid "Aw, that's pretty."
msgstr "О-о-о, как мило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD"
msgid "I can't wait to light it up."
msgstr "Не терпится его зажечь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "There's room for both of us, Luce."
msgstr "Здесь хватит места для нас обоих, Люсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "That's nice."
msgstr "Мило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Not very satisfying chopping, that."
msgstr "Не самое приятное занятие, рубить такое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "I think wildflowers look nice with my red hair."
msgstr "Думаю дикие цветы подходят к моим рыжим волосам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "Healthy, but not very hardy."
msgstr "Полезно, но не очень сытно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "Shiny!"
msgstr "Сияет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED"
msgid "It's almost out."
msgstr "Он почти всё."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "Something is wrong with that flower."
msgstr "С этим цветком что-то не так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "Someone's got a brown thumb."
msgstr "У кого-то очень корявые руки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "Looks like a salad."
msgstr "На салат похоже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Пахнет неплохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "Will this give me hockey hair?"
msgstr "У меня от него будет причёска хоккеиста?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "Funny what some folks will call a \"weed\". I think it looks nice!"
msgstr "Забавно, что какие-то ребята называют их \"сорняками\". По моему, они красивые!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Пахнет неплохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Canadian tuxedos look a bit different."
msgstr "Канадские смокинги выглядят немного иначе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "Brittle."
msgstr "Хрупкое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "One hundred percent assembled beastie."
msgstr "Теперь скелет целый на сто процентов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "Eh... Should we try again, Lucy?"
msgstr "Эх... Попробуем ещё раз, Люси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Still got some work to do, looks like."
msgstr "Похоже, над этим можно поработать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES"
msgid "I can get maple syrup on that?"
msgstr "Можно полить кленовым сиропом?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY"
msgid "See? We can all get along."
msgstr "Видишь? Мы все можем поладить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "Ex-frog."
msgstr "Бывшая лягушка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't trust anything that can't decide between air and water."
msgstr "Я не доверяю ничему, что не может выбрать между воздухом и водой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's tired."
msgstr "Она устала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL"
msgid "I'm not one to turn my nose up at a meal."
msgstr "Я не тот, кто воротит нос от еды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "You can really taste the swamp."
msgstr "Вот такое оно, болото, на вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "They're still jumping!"
msgstr "Всё ещё прыгают!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "At least they stopped moving."
msgstr "Ну хоть дёргаться перестали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON"
msgid "The fig masks the swamp taste."
msgstr "Инжир маскирует вкус болота."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI"
msgid "Nothin' like kickin' back with a cold one, eh?"
msgstr "Нет ничего лучше, чем расслабиться с чем-нибудь холодненьким, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "Just a sweet little critter."
msgstr "Просто милый маленький зверёк."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "Were you always that colourful?"
msgstr "Ты всегда был таким цветастым?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "I'll let it rest."
msgstr "Дам ему отдохнуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY"
msgid "What did the plants ever do to you, eh?"
msgstr "Да что тебе сделали эти растения, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT"
msgid "Those Fruit Flies seem to have a real liking for it."
msgstr "Этим фруктовым мушкам, похоже, действительно нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "In syrup!"
msgstr "С сиропчиком!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Shh! The creature might still be around."
msgstr "Тс-с! Создание может быть где-то рядом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING"
msgid "Yeesh, this place is overrun with shadow critters!"
msgstr "Боже ж, тут везде эти теневые паразиты!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB"
msgid "That can't be good..."
msgstr "Не к добру это..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "That's unfortunate there, buddy."
msgstr "Это печально, приятель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "Hmph. Maybe I don't got it so bad."
msgstr "М-м-м. Может, со мной не всё так плохо?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "Homegrown."
msgstr "Домашний."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Lucy helped."
msgstr "Люси помогла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Nothing like lots and lots of fresh garlic, eh?"
msgstr "Нет ничего лучше, чем много-много свежего чеснока, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Видно, новые семена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "Really cools a fella down."
msgstr "И вправду охлаждает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "I never could figure these things out."
msgstr "Никогда в них не разбирался."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC"
msgid "It's like some weird tar."
msgstr "Какая-то странная смолятина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER"
msgid "I don't think they can breath in there."
msgstr "Не думаю, что они там дышать могут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Hmm, is it worth fishin' it out?"
msgstr "Хмм, стоит ли туда руки сувать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE"
msgid "Looks potent."
msgstr "Выглядит внушительно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL"
msgid "Who'd wanna eat that now?"
msgstr "Ну, и кто теперь хочет это съесть?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's supposed to keep our lunch from spoiling, eh?"
msgstr "Она должна уберечь наш обед от порчи, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT"
msgid "I have bad memories of that gunk."
msgstr "У меня остались плохие воспоминания об этой дряни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "It'll need a gem."
msgstr "Здесь нужны камешки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "Looks ready."
msgstr "Выглядит готовым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Better to do it now than regret it later, eh?"
msgstr "Лучше сделать это сейчас, чем сожалеть потом, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's dead alright."
msgstr "Он точно мёртв."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Oh geez."
msgstr "О боже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT"
msgid "We're all connected, eh?"
msgstr "Мы все связаны, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED"
msgid "There's one in there, eh?"
msgstr "Там кто-то есть, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks empty."
msgstr "Выглядит пусто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD"
msgid "Looks like these things are getting stronger."
msgstr "Видимо, эти штуки всё крепчают."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED"
msgid "They are not happy with us, Lucy."
msgstr "Он падает прямо на нас, Люсь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "Boo! Ha ha!"
msgstr "Бу-у-у! Ха-ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER"
msgid "That ghost left a parting gift."
msgstr "Этот призрак оставил прощальный подарок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT"
msgid "I'm not scared of wearin' it, Lucy. I just don't feel like it."
msgstr "Я вовсе не боюсь надевать его, Люси. Я просто не хочу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "Whoof, smells like week-old sockeye!"
msgstr "Фу-у-уф, воняет как носок недельной свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "They're just as fun to give as they are to receive."
msgstr "Дарить подарки так же приятно, как и получать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "Should we do something nice today, Lucy?"
msgstr "Сделаем сегодня что-нибудь хорошее, а, Люси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "I prefer my houses made of wood."
msgstr "Я предпочитаю, чтоб мои дома были из дерева."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "Where ya goin', eh?"
msgstr "Куда ты бежишь, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Not like any dog I've ever seen."
msgstr "Никогда не видел таких псов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "Well, it ain't wood."
msgstr "Ну, это не дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "I feel pretty safe with it in my hand."
msgstr "Чувствую себя безопасно, держа это в руке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "I wonder if it chops."
msgstr "Вот если б это можно было срубить..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Keep flapping, little guy!"
msgstr "Маши, маши, чудик!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Snooze away, bud."
msgstr "Отоспись, приятель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "Dead and still slimy."
msgstr "Мёртвый и не менее слизкий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Even the flower is slimy."
msgstr "Даже цветок в слизи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "Yep, his slime is slimy too."
msgstr "Агась, даже его слизь слизкая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "Unsurprisingly, the wings are slimy."
msgstr "Без сомнений, крылья у него тоже слизкие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "Boy would I ever like to dig into that."
msgstr "Я бы хотел его слопать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "Not so tough now, eh?"
msgstr "Теперь уже не такой жёсткий, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "Sorry aboot the horn, bud."
msgstr "Извини за рог, приятель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "I've got a way with nature."
msgstr "У меня всегда есть способ поладить с природой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "That thing looks like it could do some damage."
msgstr "Эта штука выглядит так, будто ещё может понаделать дел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "Never saw a horn on a fish before."
msgstr "Никогда прежде не видел, чтоб у рыб были рога."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "I think the electricity curdled it."
msgstr "По-моему, из-за электричества оно свернулось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "Seems pretty useless."
msgstr "Выглядит как-то бесполезно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "It's almost as nice as Lucy."
msgstr "Почти так же хорош, как и Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "It's pretty, but it can't chop down trees."
msgstr "Ничего так, но деревья ей не порубишь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "Welp. I can't unmake it, so..."
msgstr "Не знаю зачем я это сделал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "Time to dig golden holes."
msgstr "Пора копать золотые ямы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "Now that I've made it, might as well put it to good use."
msgstr "Что ж, я её породил, я ей и воспользуюсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "You can't make a coffee table out of gold.\nWell, maybe you can. But you shouldn't."
msgstr "Нельзя делать журнальные столики из золота.\nНу хорошо, можно. Но не нужно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "Pillowy plumage."
msgstr "Мягкое оперение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "I need to poop on it."
msgstr "Нужно её удобрить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "I hope that doesn't spread to the trees."
msgstr "Надеюсь, на деревья не перекинется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "It's caught a bit of a bug."
msgstr "Это был небольшой жучок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Lookin' a bit down."
msgstr "Немного вянет, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like kindling."
msgstr "На растопку сгодится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "It's gone all nubbly."
msgstr "Одни бугорки остались."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "Maybe it'd thrive if it was cooler out?"
msgstr "Может она бы разрослась, если бы тут было чуть прохладней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "Can't tell if it's an animal or a real lively shrub."
msgstr "Не пойму, это животное или ходячий кустарник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It's lookin' pretty unhealthy."
msgstr "Совсем нездорово выглядит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "Where's the log lizard?"
msgstr "Это что... Вот если бы она брёвна несла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "That there could keep my beard moderately dry, eh?"
msgstr "Он сохранит мою бороду в сухости, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "Yup, empty."
msgstr "Агась, пустой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "It's haunted!"
msgstr "Сосуд с привидением!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "It really floats my gravy boat."
msgstr "Этот соус действительно насыщает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "I get a bit of a weird feeling around these things."
msgstr "Какие-то странные ощущение от этой штуки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "How flashy."
msgstr "Как кичливо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "That should help everyone get the lay of the land."
msgstr "Должно помочь сориентироваться на местности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "This'll help me dismantle stuff!"
msgstr "Он поможет мне разбирать вещи!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "I've eaten stranger things in the woods."
msgstr "Чего я только не ел в лесу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "I don't trust it."
msgstr "Какой-то он не такой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a green mushroom."
msgstr "Это... зелёный гриб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "They have their own schedule."
msgstr "У них свой распорядок дня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "I'll have to be patient."
msgstr "Я должен набраться терпения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "Looks almost like icebergs."
msgstr "Выглядит прям как айсберг."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "Looks almost like icebergs."
msgstr "Выглядит прям как айсберг."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "I'm not sure I trust it."
msgstr "Не уверен, что доверяю этому."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "It stinks less than the other kind."
msgstr "Дерьмо. Но воняет меньше, чем другие виды дерьма."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Never did like this stuff."
msgstr "Никогда таким не занимался."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Even the stick is delicious."
msgstr "Даже палочка вкусная."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "I'll tell you what it tastes like, Lucy."
msgstr "Я скажу тебе, как это на вкус, Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "Melts in your mouth, not in your hand."
msgstr "Тает во рту, а не в руках."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "Not the biggest fan of bugs."
msgstr "Не очень люблю букашек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "It's pretty good stuff."
msgstr "Довольно вкусно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "Lucy doesn't like it when I eat spice."
msgstr "Люси не нравится, когда я ем пряности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll eat enough for the both of us, Lucy."
msgstr "Не бойся, я буду есть за нас обоих, Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Just a regular ol' cob of corn."
msgstr "Просто обычный старый початок кукурузы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "Yeesh. That's a lot of candy legs."
msgstr "Ишь. Так много леденцов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "These ones don't puke. I like 'em."
msgstr "От этого не тошнит. Мне нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "Not sure that's food, eh?"
msgstr "Не уверен, что это еда, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "Eh. I don't mind 'em."
msgstr "Эх. Я не против."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "I'll tell you what it tastes like, Lucy."
msgstr "Я скажу тебе, как это на вкус, Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "Not too bad, eh?"
msgstr "Не так уж и плохо, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "A good hardy drink."
msgstr "Хороший напиток для выносливости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "That's a lot, eh."
msgstr "Достаточно много, а."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "Not bad."
msgstr "Неплохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "It'll never replace a good hunk of wood."
msgstr "Он никогда не заменит хороший кусок дерева."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "Not sure I need any more tranformin' in my life."
msgstr "Не уверен, что мне нужна ещё одна трансформация."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "It's just fake, eh."
msgstr "Просто подделка, а."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "That's nice. I should hang it somewhere."
msgstr "Неплохо. Надо куда-то повесить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "This would look good in a tree somewhere."
msgstr "Это будет хорошо смотреться на дереве."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "You wanna decorate, Lucy?"
msgstr "Хочешь что-нибудь украсить, Люси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "Hang in there, eh."
msgstr "Ты там повиси, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "Argh! I'd sure like to hang a real one like that."
msgstr "Ар-р-ргх! Вот бы настоящего так повесить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "What a waste of good ham."
msgstr "Эх, сколько ветчины зря пропадает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "Everyone makes mistakes, eh?"
msgstr "Любой может ошибаться, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "Packs a wallop."
msgstr "Для ударов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "It's not filled with goose down, is it?"
msgstr "Она ведь не набит гусиным пухом, верно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "At least it's not filled with feathers."
msgstr "По крайней мере, она не набита перьями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "Smells like sleeping outside."
msgstr "Пахнет так, будто спишь на улице."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Still better than one that's stuffed with nasty feathers."
msgstr "Все равно лучше, чем та, которая набита мерзкими перьями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "It's for a dare, eh? Alright, I'll bite."
msgstr "Это на спор, да? Хорошо, я укушу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "I really prefer plaid."
msgstr "Я предпочитаю шотландку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "Healthiness in goo form."
msgstr "Здоровье в виде мази."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "Oh man, that's got a real funk to it."
msgstr "Боже, в этом есть что-то такое забавное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "Someone else'd put that to better use."
msgstr "Кто-нибудь найдет этому применение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "It's gone cold, eh?"
msgstr "Совсем остыл, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Brrr! It's frozen."
msgstr "Б-р-р! Ледяной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "We call those \"night rocks\" back home."
msgstr "Дома мы зовём их \"ночными\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "I could chop all winter with that in my pocket!"
msgstr "С этой штукой в кармане я всю зиму могу лес валить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "It's getting a bit... tepid."
msgstr "Становится немного... теплее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Ready to do some pruning, Luce?"
msgstr "Готова немного подрубить, Люсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "Roses grow awfully fast around these parts."
msgstr "Розы в этих краях растут ужасно быстро."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "Not the friendliest, eh?"
msgstr "Не самая дружелюбная, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
msgid "This would have been good up north."
msgstr "На севере это было бы кстати."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
msgid "I've never gone nuts a day in my life. Right, Luce?"
msgstr "Ни разу в жизни не слетал с катушек. Так ведь, а, Люсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "Hopefully I'll know when to drink it."
msgstr "Надеюсь, не забуду его выпить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "It's from the moon, eh?"
msgstr "Этот с луны, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS"
msgid "Maybe you should have some of this, Luce."
msgstr "Может, тебе тоже стоит попробовать, Люсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Just what I need."
msgstr "То что надо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "Perfect for a hot day."
msgstr "Идеален в жаркий день."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "It even smells healthy."
msgstr "Даже пахнет полезно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
msgid "It's just garbage now."
msgstr "Теперь это всего лишь мусор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "Wish I had those around the cabin."
msgstr "Вот бы и у меня такие были вокруг хижины."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
msgid "What do you think, Luce?"
msgstr "Что думаешь, Люсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "Wonder where to move that crab to."
msgstr "Где же мне поселить крабиху?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL"
msgid "Shortcut to Pearl's."
msgstr "Короткая дорога к Жемчужинке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE"
msgid "Pearl makes a good cup of tea."
msgstr "Жемчужинка делает хороший чай."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING"
msgid "It's worth the wait."
msgstr "Ожидания того стоят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT"
msgid "Oh, Pearl. I'm so sorry."
msgstr "Ох, Жемчужинка. Мне так жаль."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "She's not in, Lucy."
msgstr "Её нет, Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "Looks comfy."
msgstr "Выглядит уютно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "It's no good to me like that."
msgstr "В таком состоянии он бесполезен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "Careful Lucy, wouldn't want you to rust."
msgstr "Осторожнее, Люси, не хочу, чтобы ты заржавела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR"
msgid "It's still being built."
msgstr "Он ещё строится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "It looks like a real home now."
msgstr "Теперь он хотя бы похож на дом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "This place has seen better days."
msgstr "У этого места были и лучшие времена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY"
msgid "I really should do my laundry."
msgstr "Мне бы тоже не помешало постирать свои вещи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT"
msgid "That would really spruce up the old cabin."
msgstr "Это бы неплохо украсило её хижину."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "I think that old hardshell's going soft on us, eh Lucy?"
msgstr "Кажись, эта старая карга уже лучше к нам относится, а, Люси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "A shell full of shells, eh?"
msgstr "Ракушка, полная ракушек, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "I was only trying to help..."
msgstr "Я всего лишь хотел помочь..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "C'mon Lucy, let's find that crab!"
msgstr "Ну же, Люси, давай найдём этого краба!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "Hmph. Real regal."
msgstr "Хмпф, как величественно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "Who's there?"
msgstr "Кто там?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Wood is the best at burning."
msgstr "А лучше всего дерево может гореть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Is there anything wood can't do?"
msgstr "Разве есть что-то, чего не может дерево?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "Let's give our neighbours some guidance."
msgstr "Давай поможем нашим соседям сориентироваться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Mmmmmm-mmmm. Bee syrup."
msgstr "М-м-м-м-м-м-м-м. Пчелиный сироп."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "The poor bees probably worked their stingers off on this."
msgstr "Бедные пчёлы, вероятно, лишились своих жал, здесь работая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "But it's not a holiday..."
msgstr "Так сейчас же не праздник..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "That's one of my favourite meals!"
msgstr "Мои любимые!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "I don't know if anyone should put their mouth on that."
msgstr "Не знаю, стоит ли это себе в рот совать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "That stuff can't be good for ya."
msgstr "Ничем хорошим оно быть не может."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE"
msgid "Of course you're more lucky, Luce!"
msgstr "Но мой талисман удачи это, конечно, ты, Люсь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Good after a long day of chopping in the cold."
msgstr "Идеален в холодный день после долгой рубки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "Lookin' purdy."
msgstr "Выглядит булькающим."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "Let's wait an' see if it fills up again."
msgstr "Давай подождем и посмотрим, наполнится ли он снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "Careful Lucy, wouldn't want you to rust."
msgstr "Осторожнее, Люси, не хочу, чтобы ты заржавела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "Wonder if I could bust through that."
msgstr "Интересно, смогу ли я прорваться через это?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "They'd be good at pulling a sled."
msgstr "В упряжку бы их, и с ветерком!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "It's covered with dog spit, eh?"
msgstr "Её собака обслюнявила, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "It's better this way."
msgstr "Пусть такой она и останется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't like the looks of that."
msgstr "Мне это совсем не нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "What on earth is happening?!"
msgstr "Что тут происходит?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "I know better than to mess with that."
msgstr "Можно найти занятие и получше, чем лезть туда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "It's a beaut."
msgstr "Это выдающийся экземпляр."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "Almost spits more teeth than a Montreal Canadien."
msgstr "Плюется зубами чаще, чем Монреаль Канадиенс."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "I usually do my own animal calls."
msgstr "Я обычно зову животных по-своему."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Friendly lil guy, eh?"
msgstr "Дружелюбный малыш, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "I've never had one of these before."
msgstr "Такой у меня никогда не было."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "It was bound to happen."
msgstr "Этим-то всё и должно было закончиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "A tiny reminder of home."
msgstr "Крошечное напоминание дома."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "Reminds me of home."
msgstr "Прямо как дома."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "It's looking a bit drippy."
msgstr "Он выглядит немного мокрым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "It's looking a bit drippy."
msgstr "Он выглядит немного мокрым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "Ahhhh. Reminds me of home."
msgstr "А-а-а-х. Вспоминается родина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Only after I've chopped enough!"
msgstr "Только после того, как нарублю достаточно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "I could chop it if I had to."
msgstr "Если надо, я и лёд могу рубить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "Arctic hounds?"
msgstr "Полярные собаки?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Good for long hikes."
msgstr "Хорош для долгих походов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "It reminds me of home."
msgstr "Напоминает мне о доме."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2"
msgid "Might need mitts for this."
msgstr "Наверное, тут пригодились бы варежки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3"
msgid "We'll send them straight to the Yukon with this."
msgstr "С этим мы отправим всех прямиком на Юкон."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "When you live up North, you get used to the cold."
msgstr "Когда живешь на Севере, привыкаешь к холоду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "Where did it go?!"
msgstr "Куда он исчез?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "I don't know how to move that."
msgstr "Я не знаю, как его сдвинуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
