msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "Reminds me of the first house we built, eh Lucy?"
msgstr "Напоминает мне наш первый дом, который мы построили, а, Люси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "He's got a pretty impressive beard."
msgstr "У него впечатляющая борода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "Sorry aboot your throne, there."
msgstr "Мне жаль твой трон."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm from a Commonwealth, myself."
msgstr "Я сам из содружества."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "It's all gone up in flames, eh?"
msgstr "Все это сгорело, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "You look like you've got this under control."
msgstr "Выглядишь так, будто у тебя всё под контролем."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "Feels like they're waiting for something."
msgstr "Такое чувство, что они чего-то ждут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "They seem chipper, eh?"
msgstr "Они кажутся бодрыми, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
msgid "We're not welcome here, Luce."
msgstr "Нам здесь не рады, Люсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED"
msgid "We're not welcome here, Luce."
msgstr "Нам здесь не рады, Люсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR"
msgid "What the heck is happening to you guys?"
msgstr "Да чем она вас кормит?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
msgid "This guy's really the best you got, eh?"
msgstr "Этот парень действительно лучший из всех, кто вообще есть, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW"
msgid "That lil' Merm really worked you to death, eh?"
msgstr "Малышка-мэрм замучала вас до смерти своей работой, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL"
msgid "Now now, Luce. Be nice."
msgstr "Тише, тише, Люсь. Будь повежливее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED"
msgid "Looks like where the scaly folks keep their tools."
msgstr "Похоже на место, где чешуйчатые ребята хранят свои инструменты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED"
msgid "Looks like where the scaly folks keep their tools."
msgstr "Похоже на место, где чешуйчатые ребята хранят свои инструменты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
msgid "Better, but why is it all slimy?"
msgstr "Стало лучше, но почему он весь склизкий?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "Sure beats a paper airplane."
msgstr "Всё же лучше бумажного самолетика."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "Wish it was filled with maple syrup..."
msgstr "Жаль, что он не был наполнен кленовым сиропом..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT"
msgid "Ah, that's too bad, eh?"
msgstr "Эх, это так плохо, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC"
msgid "So that's where all my good boards went!!"
msgstr "Так вот куда делись все мои доски!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES"
msgid "Oh... uh... do I have to touch it?"
msgstr "Ох... э-э.... а я должен это трогать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "Down deep in a coal mine."
msgstr "В глубине угольной шахты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "Light the way, little lantern!"
msgstr "Освещай путь, маленький фонарь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "I'm not used to the heat in this place!"
msgstr "Я не привык к местной жаре!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "Just needs a light."
msgstr "Просто нужно поджечь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Is there anything wood can't do?"
msgstr "Разве есть что-то, чего не может дерево?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "What is this... some sort of sign?"
msgstr "Что это... что-то вроде таблички?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "Good, sturdy wood."
msgstr "Хорошее крепкое дерево."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "Another poor soul with a curse."
msgstr "Ещё одна несчастная, проклятая душа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "That's a nice chest with horns, eh."
msgstr "Хороший сундук с рогами, а."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "That's a nice horn, eh."
msgstr "Знатный рог, а."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "It feels aboot rocks the way I feel aboot trees."
msgstr "Он воспринимает камни так же, как я - деревья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "Want some rocks?"
msgstr "Ищешь камней?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Dig, dig, dig."
msgstr "Коп-коп-коп."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT"
msgid "Just keep your nose out of my business, eh?"
msgstr "Просто не суй нос не в своё дело, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL"
msgid "Looks cozy enough."
msgstr "Выглядит достаточно уютно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "Now featuring night-time chopping!"
msgstr "Нам предстоит ночная рубка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "I bet it's just a pile of rocks inside."
msgstr "Готов поспорить, там внутри лишь груда камней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "Well then. That's a new one."
msgstr "Ну что ж. Ещё одна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "What a fine choice of building material."
msgstr "Какой здоровский набор строительных материалов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT"
msgid "Eh... maybe living in a tree ain't all it's cracked up to be."
msgstr "Эх... может быть, жизнь на дереве - это ещё не всё, на что она способна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "Huh. I wonder what it might be like to live in a tree."
msgstr "Хм. Интересно, каково это - жить на дереве?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL"
msgid "That ain't natural."
msgstr "Это точно не естественно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Did the monkeys leave this here?"
msgstr "Обезьяны оставили это здесь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR"
msgid "Fake trees? It just ain't right."
msgstr "Фальшивые деревья? Как-то это неправильно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN"
msgid "She doesn't look like the one on the back of the loonie."
msgstr "Не совсем похожа на ту, что на небе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "They're kinda like cattails except... not."
msgstr "Они вроде как рогозы но... хвостозы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT"
msgid "If a monkey can do it, so can I, eh?"
msgstr "Если с этим справилась обезьяна, то справлюсь и я, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT"
msgid "I sure hope there aren't any fleas in it."
msgstr "Буду надеяться, что в ней нету блох."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "This is cat food!"
msgstr "Кошке это отдай!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "I'm not hungry enough for that."
msgstr "Я не настолько голоден, чтобы это жрать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "I still don't want to eat it."
msgstr "И всё равно я не хочу это есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE"
msgid "Isn't there anything else to eat?"
msgstr "Тут что, есть нечего?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "That'll need more than a roll of duct tape to fix."
msgstr "Понадобится больше, чем рулон изоленты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd rather not muck with that if I can help it."
msgstr "Лучше не портить, если можно починить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "That oughta keep us cool."
msgstr "Это должно сохранить прохладу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "I'm happy to just leave it there for now."
msgstr "Я рад пока оставить это."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "Looks a little off."
msgstr "Выглядит по-другому."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Pixie dust tickles my nose."
msgstr "Пыльца фей щекочет мне нос."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "I sure do like nature."
msgstr "Я очень люблю природу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "Fancy butterfly wings."
msgstr "Необычные крылья бабочки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING"
msgid "Welcome to the world."
msgstr "Добро пожаловать в этот мир."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "We're free from the moon's reach down here."
msgstr "Здесь луна нас не достанет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Do I really need to be reminded of the moon during the day?"
msgstr "Мне правда нужно напоминать о луне весь день?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED"
msgid "Wait a minute, I don't think that's ice..."
msgstr "Погоди-ка, я не думаю, что это лёд..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "Not a good night to have a curse, but then when's it ever?"
msgstr "Не лучшее время для проклятия, хотя, когда ещё?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "The moon's gone for now. Phew."
msgstr "Пока что луна ушла. Уф."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The moon's waning. Time for some peace and quiet."
msgstr "Луна убывает. Тишина и покой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The moon's waxing again."
msgstr "Снова растущая луна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.WEREBEAVER"
msgid "Just aboot time again, Lucy."
msgstr "Вопрос времени, Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS"
msgid "It's green, like a nice leaf."
msgstr "Он зеленый, как красивый листик."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE"
msgid "Still not as good as Lucy."
msgstr "Всё ещё не так хорош, как Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED"
msgid "These pieces still have a glow to 'em."
msgstr "Эти кусочки всё ещё светятся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK"
msgid "That's a big hunk of moon stuff."
msgstr "Это большой кусок лунного вещества."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "Seems cozy enough."
msgstr "Кажется, там достаточно уютно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "I think it's missing something."
msgstr "Чего-то не хватает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "Looks kinda loonie."
msgstr "Выглядит странно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "It's uh, a moon rock."
msgstr "Это э-э, лунный камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "I should probably put this down somewhere, eh?"
msgstr "Я должен, вероятно, положить это где-то, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "That's in a pretty sorry state, eh?"
msgstr "Находится в довольно жалком состоянии, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN"
msgid "Better not disturb it."
msgstr "Лучше не трогать это."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Almost could've mistook it for ice."
msgstr "Чуть было не принял его за лёд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED"
msgid "It's got a little glow to it."
msgstr "Он немного светится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "If it works, I'm not gonna complain."
msgstr "Если это сработает, я не буду жаловаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK"
msgid "I can already feel the static in my beard."
msgstr "Я уже чувствую электростатику в своей бороде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC"
msgid "Whatever he's doin' looks pretty complicated."
msgstr "Что бы он ни делал, это выглядит довольно сложно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER"
msgid "Looks empty."
msgstr "Похоже, пусто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM"
msgid "Looks like bottled lightning."
msgstr "Похоже на молнию в бутылке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER"
msgid "We should bottle that lightning!"
msgstr "Надо бы поймать эту молнию!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "It wants to show me something."
msgstr "Он хочет мне что-то показать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP"
msgid "Oh great, now I'm really hearing voices."
msgstr "О, отлично, теперь я правда слышу голоса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL"
msgid "All back in one piece."
msgstr "Снова вместе, в целости и сохранности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC"
msgid "I don't get it, why does it feel like we're not finished yet?"
msgstr "Я не понимаю, почему мне кажется, что мы ещё не закончили?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "I know the drill, let's get you back where you belong."
msgstr "Я знаю, как это делается, давай вернём тебя туда, где тебе самое место."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
msgid "I think it wants one of those moon fissures."
msgstr "Я думаю, ему нужна одна из этих лунных трещин."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON"
msgid "You want me to get you home, eh?"
msgstr "Хочешь домой, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL"
msgid "It wants me to carry it somewhere."
msgstr "Он хочет, чтобы я его куда-то унёс."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK"
msgid "It's givn' me the heebie jeebies."
msgstr "Меня от этой штуки всего мурашит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS"
msgid "There's a little whisper coming from inside."
msgstr "Изнутри доносится тихий шепот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL"
msgid "There's a little whisper coming from inside."
msgstr "Изнутри доносится тихий шепот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "There's a little whisper coming from inside."
msgstr "Изнутри доносится тихий шепот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED"
msgid "It wants me to take it to one of those cracks in the ground."
msgstr "Он хочет, чтобы я отнес его к одной из тех трещин в земле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD"
msgid "Just how did you get underground?"
msgstr "Как ты вообще попал под землю?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP"
msgid "Not sure if I should be eatin' that."
msgstr "Даже не знаю, стоит ли мне это скушать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "The smell's enough to wake you up."
msgstr "Этого запаха достаточно, чтобы прийти в себя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1"
msgid "Might as well help the old guy out, eh?"
msgstr "С таким же успехом можно было бы помочь старику, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2"
msgid "Still a bit of building left to do."
msgstr "Осталось ещё кое-что построить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC"
msgid "Huh. Whattaya figure it's for, Luce?"
msgstr "Ха. Для чего, по-твоему, это нужно, Люсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC"
msgid "Oddly inviting, isn't it?"
msgstr "Странно заманчиво, не правда ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT"
msgid "That's a crack in the ground, eh?"
msgstr "Это же трещина в земле, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED"
msgid "Guess sometimes stubbornness pays off, eh Lucy?"
msgstr "Наверное, иногда упрямство окупается, а, Люси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Yeesh, that's a big blaze."
msgstr "Да, это большое пламя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "It burnt down, eh?"
msgstr "Он сгорел дотла, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "I might have chopped more than once."
msgstr "Я мог бы срубить и не один раз."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Measure twice, chop once."
msgstr "Семь раз отмерь, один сруби."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "That's an awfully pretty blossom."
msgstr "Ужасно красивый цветок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Пахнет неплохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "Whatever it is, it's definitely Canadian."
msgstr "Что бы это ни было, оно определённо Канадец."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "Well, it lays eggs, apparently."
msgstr "Ну, по-видимому, оно откладывает яйца."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "Where's the pyromaniac? This needs to burn."
msgstr "Где пиромант? Это нужно сжечь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA"
msgid "My mouth is watering just looking at it."
msgstr "Аж слюна течёт когда смотрю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "That'll take a pint out of me!"
msgstr "Он из меня не меньше поллитры высосет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "What do I do with this, eh?"
msgstr "И что с ним делать, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB"
msgid "That's one angry bag of skeeters."
msgstr "Полный мешок злющих комаров."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER"
msgid "I don't think that's ketchup."
msgstr "Не думаю, что это кетчуп."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE"
msgid "I guess there's some justice to it."
msgstr "Думаю, в этом есть доля справедливости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK"
msgid "A stuffed skeeter? This is what the kids like these days, eh?"
msgstr "Плюшевый комар? И это нравится детям в наше время а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "Blood and guts, eh?"
msgstr "Кровь с кишками, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "Feathery moose baby!"
msgstr "Детёныш пернатого лося!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "Don't be mad!"
msgstr "Не злись!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "I should probably leave that alone."
msgstr "Пожалуй, мне лучше её не трогать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK"
msgid "Nothin better against the cold!"
msgstr "От холода нет ничего лучше глинтвейна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "That'd be the thing I fell through, eh."
msgstr "Наверно это та штуковина, через которую я сюда выпал, а."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "Wonder where it goes."
msgstr "Интересно, куда он ведёт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "It's... it's beautiful."
msgstr "Он... он прекрасен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME"
msgid "Funny little guy, eh?"
msgstr "Забавный парняга, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "I don't like the look of that."
msgstr "Не нравится мне, как она выглядит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "That there'll make you one with the forest."
msgstr "То, что объединит меня с лесом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "Don't breathe it in, Lucy!"
msgstr "Не вдыхай, Люси!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "Mushrooms don't have no reason to be that big."
msgstr "Грибы не должны быть такими большими."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "If a log burns in the forest does it hurt my feelings? Yes. It does."
msgstr "Задевает ли меня, когда дерево горит? Да, задевает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "It needs a bit of help getting started."
msgstr "Им нужно чуть помочь для роста."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "It's doing real well on its own."
msgstr "И сама неплохо справляется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "That rotten log needs replacing."
msgstr "Нужно заменить это гнилое бревно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "Everybody's got hardships, eh?"
msgstr "У всех бывают тяжёлые времена, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "There we go. Everyone needs a bit of help sometimes."
msgstr "А вот и мы. Всем когда-нибудь нужна чья-либо помощь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "Doesn't need us no more."
msgstr "Уход больше не нужен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "Whose bright idea was it to kill the lights?"
msgstr "Кому пришло в голову убить огоньки?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "My kind of decor."
msgstr "Моя любимая обстановка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "Soak in that all-natural light, Lucy."
msgstr "Купайся в натуральном свете, Люси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "That got charred real good."
msgstr "Очень хорошо обуглилось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "It oughta be green like a lush, choppable forest."
msgstr "Зелёный, как пышный, срубленный лес."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "It illuminates with all the colours of the wind."
msgstr "Освещает всеми цветами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "Для меня они все одинаковы. Пора заняться рубкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "I like the colour of this one."
msgstr "Мне нравится его цвет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe I should chop it."
msgstr "Наверно стоит срубить его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON"
msgid "I think it's due for a choppin'."
msgstr "Думаю, и тебя срубить можно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "Для меня они все одинаковы. Пора заняться рубкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Well, I can't cut it down now..."
msgstr "Ну, я теперь не могу его срезать..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's made of wood."
msgstr "Деревянное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "Для меня они все одинаковы. Пора заняться рубкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Chop it down before it spreads!"
msgstr "Срубить его, пока оно не размножилось!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't let that stand."
msgstr "Нельзя его так оставлять."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "All the same to me. Let's get to choppin'."
msgstr "Для меня они все одинаковы. Пора заняться рубкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC"
msgid "This one needs pruning, at least."
msgstr "Его хотя бы подрезать нужно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER"
msgid "Lookit those mitts! Someone get this tendy a twig!"
msgstr "Посмотри на эти руки! Кто-нибудь, принесите этому нежному прутик!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD"
msgid "I hate you more than anything."
msgstr "Я ненавижу тебя больше всего на свете."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE"
msgid "We need to get outta here, Luce."
msgstr "Нам нужно убираться отсюда, Люсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh man. That's bad. So bad."
msgstr "О боже. Это плохо. Очень плохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS"
msgid "It's growin' icicles? Must be from Quebec."
msgstr "На нём сосульки растут? Из Квебека, походу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead."
msgstr "Он мёртв."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "That just ain't right."
msgstr "Это просто неправильно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING"
msgid "Let's not wake it."
msgstr "Давайте не будем его будить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG"
msgid "You are one strange lookin' pooch."
msgstr "Какая ты странная дворняга."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "И скатертью дорожка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's like a bird, but worse."
msgstr "Это выглядит как птица, но ещё хуже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "Let's not wake it."
msgstr "Давайте не будем его будить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Извини, дружок, думаю, мне придётся отказаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER"
msgid "Sorry little buddy, I think I'll have to pass."
msgstr "Извини, дружок, думаю, мне придётся отказаться."

