#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.greenstaff_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.greenstaff_an"
msgid "Artfully break down old concepts to create something new."
msgstr "Искусно ломайте старые концепции, чтобы создать что-то новое."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.greenstaff_clockwork
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.greenstaff_clockwork"
msgid "A construct of deconstruction."
msgstr "Конструкция для деконструкции."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.greenstaff_planet
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.greenstaff_planet"
msgid "A tool of mass deconstruction."
msgstr "Оружие массового разрушения."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_nautical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_nautical"
msgid "This portly pufferfish is trying to pass itself off as pork."
msgstr "Эта пухлая рыба-ёж пытается выдать себя за свинину."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_potroast
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_potroast"
msgid "Delicious, delicious murder."
msgstr "Восхитительное, восхитительное убийство."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_spiralcut
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_spiralcut"
msgid "This ham bat was fashioned after the scepter of the great Battlemaster Pugna."
msgstr "Эта мясная бита была сделана сразу после той, которой владел великий Военачальник Пугна."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_crowbar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_crowbar"
msgid "A mighty man hammers with a crowbar."
msgstr "Сильный человек может и ломом забить."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_forge
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_forge"
msgid "Watch out for the spikey bits."
msgstr "Осторожно, у него острые концы."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_hammush
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_hammush"
msgid "Make mush with mush."
msgstr "Пусть твои враги огрибут по полной."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_invisible
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_invisible"
msgid "Convey an incredibly convincing impression of a hammer."
msgstr "Создаёт невероятно убедительное ощущение молота."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_rw_startingforest
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_rw_startingforest"
msgid "Pound them to a pulp!"
msgstr "Отбей из них котлету!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_brown_beaver
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_brown_beaver"
msgid "'Werebeaver brown' colored gloves with a buckle on the back to help you hold it together."
msgstr "Боброво-коричневые перчатки с застёжками на тыльной стороне, чтобы надёжней сидели на кистях."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_navy_ocean
