#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_victorian"
msgid "Winona dreams up all sorts of fantastic mechanical inventions in her private workshop."
msgstr "В своей мастерской Винона мечтает о самых разных фантастических механических изобретениях."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_wrestler"
msgid "Winona's ready for her grudge match."
msgstr "Винона готова к матчу."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_yule"
msgid "Winona always liked the sense of camaraderie that emerges between people in the bleak of winter."
msgstr "Виноне всегда нравилось чувство товарищества, которое возникает между людьми в суровую зиму."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winonabattery_high_fancy
