msgctxt "STRINGS.STORYTELLER.WALTER.CAMPFIRE.WEREBEAVER_STORY.lines.8.line"
msgid "he would turn into a hulking, hairy beast,"
msgstr "он превратится в неуклюжего, волосатого зверя,"

#. STRINGS.STORYTELLER.WALTER.CAMPFIRE.WEREBEAVER_STORY.lines.9.duration
